Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:36.69,en,,0,0,0,,What if this was your house? Power's out. Lights are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.96,en,,0,0,0,,Your little ones in their bunk bed down the hall, crying out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.37,en,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy! Come quick! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:43.60,en,,0,0,0,,- You need to get there, and fast. - Coming, honey! Daddy's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:46.14,en,,0,0,0,,You'll need a weapon. But first, you'll need a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.17,en,,0,0,0,,But you're in the dark! What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.21,en,,0,0,0,,How are you gonna find it? I'll tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.01,en,,0,0,0,,The Glow-in-the-Dark Flashlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.71,en,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks! I'm Larry Daley of Daley Devices,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:58.01,en,,0,0,0,,and we're gonna spend the next paid-programing block
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.38,en,,0,0,0,,rocking your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:03.39,en,,0,0,0,,And I brought along a friend to do it. George Foreman, ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:08.28,en,,0,0,0,,Fantastic, Larry, fantastic! Isn't he fantastic, America?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.70,en,,0,0,0,,But, seriously, isn't it true that just two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.40,en,,0,0,0,,you were working as a night guard at some dusty museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:22.24,en,,0,0,0,,That is true, two-time world heavyweight champ George Foreman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.54,en,,0,0,0,,I was just a regular Joe with a flashlight and a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:28.64,en,,0,0,0,,You mean a regular Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:41.32,en,,0,0,0,,But what's no joke is you're CEO of Daley Devices,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:46.16,en,,0,0,0,,creator of such indispensable items as the Super Big Dog Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:50.29,en,,0,0,0,,- You like that one? - The Unlosable Key Ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.00,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that little chestnut!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:56.13,en,,0,0,0,,And now your latest breakthrough... Say it with me, America!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:58.97,en,,0,0,0,,The Glow-in-the-Dark Flashlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.45,en,,0,0,0,,Whatever the household crisis, this is Daley Devices. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.99,en,,0,0,0,,Tina, give this back to Stewart. I don't trust his math, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.65,en,,0,0,0,,- That guy called again. - Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:12.72,en,,0,0,0,,Lar! Huge news! We got the Wal-Mart meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.42,en,,0,0,0,,- No! When? - Yeah. Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.59,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right. We got a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:21.00,en,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, did you just hear me say "Wal" and "Mart" together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.57,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I know, it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:24.67,en,,0,0,0,,So just take a second to be happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.10,en,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.91,en,,0,0,0,,You're totally making fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.17,en,,0,0,0,,No, let's hold off on the victory parade till we close, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.95,en,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.78,en,,0,0,0,,- And when does he want to meet? - They want Friday morning, 10:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.61,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, you know what? Cancel that pitch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.88,en,,0,0,0,,for the electric saw thing with the propeller, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:40.28,en,,0,0,0,,- I just want to focus on this. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.08,en,,0,0,0,,- Just this. - My daughter's birthday, canceled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.53,en,,0,0,0,,You can go home. I'm gonna be pretty late, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.20,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.78,en,,0,0,0,,Hello! Excuse me! Unauthorized personnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:20.59,en,,0,0,0,,If it isn't our very own Mr. Success Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.63,en,,0,0,0,,Come for one of your nostalgia tours? I haven't seen you for a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:27.69,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been busy. What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:30.87,en,,0,0,0,,Progress, so they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:37.31,en,,0,0,0,,The future. Behold, Natural History, version 2.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:47.02,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome to The Museum of Natural History, where history comes to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.92,en,,0,0,0,,Step up, ask your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:51.42,en,,0,0,0,,Then let the next little boy or girl have their turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:56.46,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, where were you born?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.89,en,,0,0,0,,Right here in New York City, on Twentieth Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:02.47,en,,0,0,0,,October 27th, the year of our Lord 1858.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:08.60,en,,0,0,0,,Blah, blah, blah. History, history. Learning, learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.90,en,,0,0,0,,Changing America, one child at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.25,en,,0,0,0,,That's great. So you're adding some new interactive exhibits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:19.21,en,,0,0,0,,No, Mr. Daley, not adding. Replacing the old exhibits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.88,en,,0,0,0,,- Where are they going? - Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.75,en,,0,0,0,,We're getting rid of all this junk. The dioramas, the waxworks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:28.56,en,,0,0,0,,even some of the shabbier animals, like this scrawny little monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.43,en,,0,0,0,,You should be careful. He's a capuchin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.39,en,,0,0,0,,It's a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.40,en,,0,0,0,,He's a rare breed. He's a capuchin. He's not just a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.71,en,,0,0,0,,"Monkey", then. I said "monkey". Why be specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.94,en,,0,0,0,,When you're throwing away a monkey, you don't need the Latin name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.58,en,,0,0,0,,Are you throwing him away or are you moving him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:47.87,en,,0,0,0,,What are you, the Primate Garbage Police? Let it go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.27,en,,0,0,0,,- Whose idea was this? - Me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.22,en,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge. Me and the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.68,en,,0,0,0,,Mainly the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.98,en,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.99,en,,0,0,0,,No, it's just that people love this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:02.12,en,,0,0,0,,People, Mr. Daley, love "What's next?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.59,en,,0,0,0,,You should know that. You left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.69,en,,0,0,0,,My situation changed. My business took off...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.43,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you became a success. So would I, if I was a night guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.74,en,,0,0,0,,So where are these guys going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.31,en,,0,0,0,,Deep storage. Federal Archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.41,en,,0,0,0,,- Where's that? - Washington, D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.51,en,,0,0,0,,The Smithsonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.25,en,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something that we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:28.19,en,,0,0,0,,It's done! They leave tomorrow morning. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:08.92,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, how you doing? How you doing with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.63,en,,0,0,0,,You want what's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:15.60,en,,0,0,0,,You think I got something for you? You think I got a little rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.47,en,,0,0,0,,Think you're stronger than me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:20.13,en,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:40.79,en,,0,0,0,,Lawrence! Good to see you, lad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:42.33,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you too, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:44.46,en,,0,0,0,,The Guardian of Brooklyn has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.77,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ahk. Look, McPhee told me what's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.23,en,,0,0,0,,- I had no idea. - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.10,en,,0,0,0,,A lot has transpired, Lawrence, since your last visit. One would say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.54,en,,0,0,0,,- Just... - Cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:10:01.35,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bocephus! Little help over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:05.28,en,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:09.05,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, fellas. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.66,en,,0,0,0,,Well, lookee here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:14.22,en,,0,0,0,,If it ain't Mr. Big-in-the-Britches himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.70,en,,0,0,0,,come back just in time to see us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.20,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Jed, I heard. Look, I don't even know how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:23.89,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, real mystery how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:27.44,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe the answer's on that magic buzzing box there in your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:30.78,en,,0,0,0,,You weren't here, Gigantor! That's how it happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.18,en,,0,0,0,,Ain't no mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:35.21,en,,0,0,0,,The fact is, Larry, there's no one else here to speak on our behalf
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.51,en,,0,0,0,,during business hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.88,en,,0,0,0,,None, none, dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.52,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:45.99,en,,0,0,0,,I'll call the board in the morning, all right? I got some pull now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.99,en,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this. We're gonna be okay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.43,en,,0,0,0,,"We"? Did you hear that? You hear Daydream Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:54.39,en,,0,0,0,,There ain't been a "we" ever since you put us on the "pay no mind" list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.77,en,,0,0,0,,And that's a cold place to be, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:59.07,en,,0,0,0,,Larry, what's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:03.88,en,,0,0,0,,Even the glory of Rome had to come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.21,en,,0,0,0,,Would you please not look dramatically off into the middle distance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.87,en,,0,0,0,,when you say that? It makes me feel worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:12.05,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.24,en,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking? Where are you looking? I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.79,en,,0,0,0,,Just a bit of wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.55,en,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, maybe it won't be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.66,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, you make a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:27.00,en,,0,0,0,,But this is the Smithsonian we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.56,en,,0,0,0,,Dexter, you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:34.31,en,,0,0,0,,You're missing the point, Gigantor! They're shipping us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.74,en,,0,0,0,,Larry, I know you're trying to make us feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.71,en,,0,0,0,,I can see that you're genuinely slightly bothered,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.88,en,,0,0,0,,but it's never going to be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.48,en,,0,0,0,,All of us here, together, in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:47.05,en,,0,0,0,,It ain't never gonna be home, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:53.59,en,,0,0,0,,Jedediah, please! Lawrence, these are emotional times for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.49,en,,0,0,0,,But it is our last night as a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:59.40,en,,0,0,0,,and I don't want to see it squandered in self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:05.20,en,,0,0,0,,So who will join me for one final stroll through these hallowed halls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.84,en,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to go for a walk? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:13.40,en,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna squander it in self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.58,en,,0,0,0,,My dear, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.94,en,,0,0,0,,Safe journey, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.85,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dexter, want some help there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.86,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, man. No hard feelings, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.79,en,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.13,en,,0,0,0,,It's almost dawn, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:09.86,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So, where's your crate, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.80,en,,0,0,0,,I won't be making this journey, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:15.54,en,,0,0,0,,It seems myself, Rexy, and a few of the signature exhibits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.20,en,,0,0,0,,will be staying here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:20.51,en,,0,0,0,,Without the tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:24.21,en,,0,0,0,,In truth, Lawrence,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:31.32,en,,0,0,0,,Ahkmenrah's tablet will be remaining here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.99,0:13:34.09,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.89,en,,0,0,0,,They're going without the tablet, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.40,en,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this night is their last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:43.26,en,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:47.50,en,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's more noble to tell a small lie than deliver a painful truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:05.91,en,,0,0,0,,- Are you gonna be okay? - I shall do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.85,en,,0,0,0,,And who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.80,en,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the greatest change brings about even greater opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.39,en,,0,0,0,,Look at you, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:19.20,en,,0,0,0,,You left this place and created quite a life for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.63,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:26.24,en,,0,0,0,,I should hope you'd do more than guess, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:29.81,en,,0,0,0,,You're a captain of industry. The world at your fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.88,0:14:31.48,en,,0,0,0,,It seems to me you have everything you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.71,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.31,en,,0,0,0,,No, you don't. If I may, lad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.42,en,,0,0,0,,allow me to offer you one piece of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:44.96,en,,0,0,0,,The key to happiness, to true happiness, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:48.96,en,,0,0,0,,Hang on one sec. I just gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.23,en,,0,0,0,,I got this Japanese deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:56.64,en,,0,0,0,,No, okay, I'm turning this off. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.80,en,,0,0,0,,The key to happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.65,en,,0,0,0,,I'll see you, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.35,en,,0,0,0,,So they're gone? There's nothing you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.69,en,,0,0,0,,I wish there was, man. I'm telling you, I tried everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:48.23,en,,0,0,0,,I talked to McPhee, I called the board, but they shipped them out this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.85,en,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of food, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.56,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Ed from work's gonna come by. I thought I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.83,en,,0,0,0,,We just have to go over a couple of little work things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:58.24,en,,0,0,0,,- So you're working tonight. - I used to work every night, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.97,en,,0,0,0,,That was when you had the coolest job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.58,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, "cool" doesn't pay for your Guitar God VI or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.98,en,,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Gigantor! It's me, Jedediah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.54,en,,0,0,0,,- Hold! Hold! - Jed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.02,en,,0,0,0,,Never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.42,en,,0,0,0,,Jed, what are you... How did you dial the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.99,en,,0,0,0,,Long story! That brazen little monkey stole the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:19.18,en,,0,0,0,,and now we're in a world of hurt, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.42,en,,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - Kahmunrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:24.39,en,,0,0,0,,- Kahmunrah? - Ahkmenrah's big brother! He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.56,en,,0,0,0,,And trust me, not a friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.36,en,,0,0,0,,I repeat, not a friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.40,en,,0,0,0,,- Is that Attila, Jed? - I don't know how much longer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:31.90,en,,0,0,0,,- we can fight them off! No! - Jed? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.40,en,,0,0,0,,- Let go of me! Help! - Hey, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.44,en,,0,0,0,,- Let go! No, you let go of me! Help! - Jed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.24,en,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.84,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.22,en,,0,0,0,,Here, come on. Gonna drop you off at your mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.95,en,,0,0,0,,- What's going on, Dad? - I'm gonna go find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.76,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, buddy, McPhee said the Federal Archives are in the Smithsonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.30,en,,0,0,0,,Where exactly am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:02.60,en,,0,0,0,,That's the thing, Dad. The Smithsonian is actually 19 different museums.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.40,en,,0,0,0,,They're laid out around the National Mall,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:07.10,en,,0,0,0,,from the Capitol to the Lincoln Memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.30,en,,0,0,0,,They got everything there. There's actually some really cool stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:13.61,en,,0,0,0,,Nicky, please focus. Which museum are the Archives in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:17.28,en,,0,0,0,,Not in, under. It looks like it runs underneath the entire Smithsonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:19.59,en,,0,0,0,,So if Ahkmenrah's tablet is down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:22.14,en,,0,0,0,,The biggest museum in the world is coming alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:23.89,en,,0,0,0,,What is exactly is your plan here, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.29,en,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry about it. - You have no plan, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:29.60,en,,0,0,0,,Now, Nicholas, I have a very good, highly thought-out plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.06,en,,0,0,0,,- You have no plan. - Yes, I have no plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.50,en,,0,0,0,,I'll call you when I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.14,en,,0,0,0,,Here you go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.46,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the biggest museum in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.50,en,,0,0,0,,I know, right? It's a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:08.69,en,,0,0,0,,How about these planes dangling from the ceilings, huh? Pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.50,en,,0,0,0,,Hi, excuse me. Could you tell me how to get to the Federal Archives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:15.77,en,,0,0,0,,Of course. Just be a historical document worthy of storing for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.17,en,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. He's not a document.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:23.55,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, the Archives are underground, and they're a secure area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:27.31,en,,0,0,0,,Really? Like, totally secure? Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:14.03,en,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the museum will be closing in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.44,en,,0,0,0,,Kahmunrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:09.35,en,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.89,en,,0,0,0,,- No touching. - No, I wasn't gonna touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.95,en,,0,0,0,,You're moving in with some I.T.T., bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:17.19,en,,0,0,0,,- I.T. T? - That's "Intent to Touch", homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:19.36,en,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't. You're not allowed to go over the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.80,en,,0,0,0,,- What, are you gonna kiss it? - All right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.10,en,,0,0,0,,Put your hand on it and touch it. 'Cause I stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.87,en,,0,0,0,,and I wait all day for a little girl like you to come in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:30.07,en,,0,0,0,,and put her precious nail-polished nails all over the exhibits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:32.94,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Last time I checked, I thought we lived in a free country, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.10,en,,0,0,0,,- No, we don't. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.58,en,,0,0,0,,It's the United States of Don't Touch That Thing Right in Front of You.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.28,en,,0,0,0,,I just want to... I'm allowed to look at it here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.78,en,,0,0,0,,See what happens when you touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:42.15,en,,0,0,0,,So you're threatening me? You're threatening me, Brandon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.16,en,,0,0,0,,- It's "Brundon." - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.72,en,,0,0,0,,- "Brundon"! - "Brundon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.49,en,,0,0,0,,- "Brundon." - "Brundon."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:50.26,en,,0,0,0,,What, did they run out of U's on your nameplate maker?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.66,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know, did they run out of jokes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.60,en,,0,0,0,,at the interesting-joke store that you shop at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.90,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it looks like "Brandon", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:57.96,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to be your speech therapist. It's "Brundon"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.66,en,,0,0,0,,- "Brundon." Okay... - You never heard of the name before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:01.07,en,,0,0,0,,"Brundon"? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.44,en,,0,0,0,,Look up most popular baby names in 1984. "Brundon."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.14,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Are you threatening me, Brundon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.58,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Princess Jasmine. Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:12.11,en,,0,0,0,,- Oh, wow. Lunabeam nine-volt. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.48,en,,0,0,0,,Wonderful piece of hardware, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.28,en,,0,0,0,,- That's their title, Lunabeam Nine. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:17.82,en,,0,0,0,,I prefer the Maglite LED myself, but that's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.82,en,,0,0,0,,- Do me a huge favor. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:23.92,en,,0,0,0,,Shove your hands into your pockets, put your attitude way down,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.79,en,,0,0,0,,and, also, be nice to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:28.43,en,,0,0,0,,Great. But could I just ask you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:30.26,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. - Okay, so just to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:33.53,en,,0,0,0,,- so, I can't do this, right? - Okay, that's actually crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.34,en,,0,0,0,,Did you just make a decision to possibly end your life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:36.43,en,,0,0,0,,earlier than you were expecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:37.81,en,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit you with the flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.87,en,,0,0,0,,- Now you are threatening me. Okay. - Do not touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:41.54,en,,0,0,0,,- Don't touch me. - Do not touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:42.95,en,,0,0,0,,- Do not touch it! - Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.31,en,,0,0,0,,I'll touch you with my flashlight all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:45.94,en,,0,0,0,,No, your flashlight is meant to illuminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:48.51,en,,0,0,0,,I will literally rent a camper,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:51.11,en,,0,0,0,,and we will drive across America with my flashlight on your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:53.13,en,,0,0,0,,- Don't do that. - Don't do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:54.86,en,,0,0,0,,Want to see what happens when I do it one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.90,en,,0,0,0,,- Let's see what happens. - Watch you do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.79,en,,0,0,0,,Let's watch you do nothing when I do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.96,en,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Brandon...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:04.23,en,,0,0,0,,- Brundon. - Brundon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.07,en,,0,0,0,,you do not know who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:08.66,en,,0,0,0,,You think you know what it means to be a guard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.87,en,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you don't know the meaning of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:14.01,en,,0,0,0,,I have seen things that you could not imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:16.88,en,,0,0,0,,- Like what kind of stuff? - I'm not gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:18.71,en,,0,0,0,,- But you're gonna drop the flashlight... - The way you said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.68,en,,0,0,0,,it sounded like you were gonna say something cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.75,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you don't get to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.35,en,,0,0,0,,Drop the flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:34.50,en,,0,0,0,,We cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:37.10,en,,0,0,0,,That's actually pretty cool, what you just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:38.53,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:40.40,en,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:43.20,en,,0,0,0,,- All right? Sorry. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.27,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry. - No, It's my fault. I shouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.40,en,,0,0,0,,No. It takes two opposing forces to cause friction, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.11,en,,0,0,0,,And you're just doing your job, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:52.05,en,,0,0,0,,- Take it easy, man. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:54.95,en,,0,0,0,,That guy's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:42.79,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay, buddy, I'm in. - Great. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.70,en,,0,0,0,,The northeast corridor of the Castle, just off the Commons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.77,0:23:47.97,en,,0,0,0,,- I need you to talk me to the Archives. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:49.77,en,,0,0,0,,At the end of the hall, turn right,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:51.78,en,,0,0,0,,and there should be a stairwell coming up on your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:54.85,en,,0,0,0,,- Got it. - Now, it's kind of a maze down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:57.64,en,,0,0,0,,Those underground tunnels connect a bunch of different buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.75,0:23:59.31,en,,0,0,0,,- It could get complicated. - We'd better hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:01.32,en,,0,0,0,,we only got 28 minutes till sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:04.52,en,,0,0,0,,When you get down to B level, you want to take another left...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:07.75,en,,0,0,0,,- Nick? Hello? Nick? - Dad! Can you hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:09.26,en,,0,0,0,,Nick, you're... Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:39.72,en,,0,0,0,,- ID, Brundon. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.36,0:24:42.83,en,,0,0,0,,- Later, dude. - All right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:55.14,en,,0,0,0,,All right. Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.43,0:26:29.26,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:05.37,en,,0,0,0,,You little troublemaker. I'm gonna deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:46.94,en,,0,0,0,,No. No! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.53,0:28:07.26,en,,0,0,0,,No, English. English, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.74,0:28:10.13,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:16.10,en,,0,0,0,,I am Kahmunrah, the great king of the great kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.21,0:28:19.58,en,,0,0,0,,and from the darkest depths of ancient history,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:23.55,en,,0,0,0,,I have come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:30.51,en,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you did not hear what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:36.09,en,,0,0,0,,I am a centuries-old Egyptian Pharaoh. I was dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:40.60,en,,0,0,0,,but now I have come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.33,0:28:44.30,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no. I heard that. I got that. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.81,0:28:52.80,en,,0,0,0,,- Who are you? - Larry Daley. Daley Devices?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:57.01,en,,0,0,0,,It's up in New York. It's funny, I know your brother, Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.41,en,,0,0,0,,- Do you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:02.18,en,,0,0,0,,He knows baby brother. The favorite son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:04.78,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, good kid. - Isn't he just?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:07.96,en,,0,0,0,,You know, Mother and Father always gave him the best of everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.03,0:29:11.26,en,,0,0,0,,and I do mean everything. They even gave him the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.80,0:29:14.13,en,,0,0,0,,The throne which was rightfully mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.60,en,,0,0,0,,- He never mentioned that. - I'll just bet he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:24.04,en,,0,0,0,,Well, now begins the era of Kahmunrah, because I have come back to...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:26.01,en,,0,0,0,,Never mind, just hand me the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.11,0:29:28.31,en,,0,0,0,,Don't give it to him, Gigantor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:30.87,en,,0,0,0,,Silence! Silence in there, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:35.12,en,,0,0,0,,- Don't make me come in there! - No! I won't be muzzled!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:38.41,en,,0,0,0,,Look, that tablet is more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.49,0:29:42.99,en,,0,0,0,,than you, Larry Daley of Daley Devices, can possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.23,0:29:47.17,en,,0,0,0,,Bringing things back to life is just a parlor trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:50.46,en,,0,0,0,,With it, I shall unlock the Gate to the Underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:54.17,en,,0,0,0,,and bring forth my army from the Land of the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:57.18,en,,0,0,0,,So, if it's not too much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:02.08,en,,0,0,0,,...hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:06.22,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.72,0:30:09.31,en,,0,0,0,,Wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:15.32,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. I'm sorry, I thought you wanted the Cube, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.87,0:30:20.36,en,,0,0,0,,The Cube?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.60,0:30:24.47,en,,0,0,0,,The Cube of Rubik.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.27,0:30:32.94,en,,0,0,0,,All right, what is this Cube of Rubik, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:37.98,en,,0,0,0,,The Cube. You know, the one that turns all who oppose you to dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.58,0:30:40.98,en,,0,0,0,,That one? Whatever. I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.09,0:30:43.08,en,,0,0,0,,It was my bad, 'cause... You know what? By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.16,0:30:44.78,en,,0,0,0,,your brother didn't want to mess with it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:46.22,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he wanted to play it safe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:49.32,en,,0,0,0,,Just, you sort of struck me as a next-level sort of guy, so I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:53.80,en,,0,0,0,,I am not my brother, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.40,0:30:58.36,en,,0,0,0,,I will kill you and your friends in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:04.07,en,,0,0,0,,Now take me to this Cube of Rubik.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:08.48,en,,0,0,0,,- Here it is. - Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.98,0:31:39.97,en,,0,0,0,,Come back here! Come back here with my tablet!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:41.60,en,,0,0,0,,I still have your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.62,0:32:22.61,en,,0,0,0,,- Take the wheel! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.72,0:32:26.21,en,,0,0,0,,I said, take the wheel! Oh, we're in it now! I love it! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:28.35,en,,0,0,0,,Just keep her straight, I'll handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.43,0:32:30.45,en,,0,0,0,,Now, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:41.36,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay, so what's the plan here? - We're Americans! We don't plan, we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.44,0:32:43.20,en,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:58.18,en,,0,0,0,,See that? Act first, think later! Works every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.26,0:32:59.62,en,,0,0,0,,You're in good hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.76,0:33:03.46,en,,0,0,0,,General George A. Custer of the Fighting U.S. 7th Cavalry,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.56,0:33:05.19,en,,0,0,0,,at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:11.93,en,,0,0,0,,I'm good, I'm good! Fly, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.45,0:33:23.81,en,,0,0,0,,What's the rumpus, ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:25.25,en,,0,0,0,,Look, lady, could you get out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.32,0:33:27.91,en,,0,0,0,,Lady? Who are you calling lady? The name is Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:36.99,en,,0,0,0,,Amelia Earhart! Perhaps you've heard of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:39.86,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. You're a famous pilot or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:42.66,en,,0,0,0,,Pilot? I was the first woman to fly the Atlantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.77,0:33:44.36,en,,0,0,0,,First woman to receive the Flying Cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:47.46,en,,0,0,0,,first woman to fly across the 48 states in a gyroprop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.54,0:33:50.37,en,,0,0,0,,Now if you'd wipe that perhaps-permanent look of alarm off your kisser,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:54.67,en,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you might be so kind as to tell me exactly where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.75,0:33:57.15,en,,0,0,0,,You're in a museum. Or, actually, under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.22,0:34:00.01,en,,0,0,0,,And I'm in kind of a dangerous situation right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.09,0:34:02.55,en,,0,0,0,,so you might not want to be anywhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:07.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Wow, you're fast. - What's your name, flyboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.73,0:34:09.85,en,,0,0,0,,My name is Larry Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:12.83,en,,0,0,0,,Well, Larry Daley, in case you weren't listening,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.90,0:34:15.03,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not one to shy away from danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.37,0:34:18.86,en,,0,0,0,,How about spears? Are you one to shy away from spears?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:23.73,en,,0,0,0,,Let's ankle, skipper! Now we're gonna have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.35,0:34:31.51,en,,0,0,0,,Ninety-eight, ninety-nine, bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.79,0:34:35.38,en,,0,0,0,,Like a Golden Fleece.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.29,0:34:39.88,en,,0,0,0,,All right, troops, when your enemies captured me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.96,0:34:42.12,en,,0,0,0,,they made themselves my enemies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.90,0:34:45.59,en,,0,0,0,,Big mistake. Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:50.39,en,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.24,0:34:55.11,en,,0,0,0,,On the third bugle blast, I shall loudly announce, "Attack!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.04,0:35:03.31,en,,0,0,0,,At which point, we will all jump out of this box
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.05,0:35:06.61,en,,0,0,0,,and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.23,0:35:17.09,en,,0,0,0,,Mind bomb. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.60,0:35:22.09,en,,0,0,0,,You, Sacaja...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.17,0:35:23.40,en,,0,0,0,,That is not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.47,0:35:25.49,en,,0,0,0,,- Sacajamea. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.60,0:35:27.83,en,,0,0,0,,- Sack-in-a-box. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.94,0:35:30.67,en,,0,0,0,,- Cinco de Mayo. - I know you are a famous general...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.78,0:35:33.11,en,,0,0,0,,That's all right, that's all right. I'm a person, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.78,0:35:36.34,en,,0,0,0,,But won't yelling, "Attack!" Alert the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.45,0:35:37.94,en,,0,0,0,,that we are about to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.45,0:35:39.78,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.29,0:35:50.19,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.20,0:35:58.07,en,,0,0,0,,You're quite the popular fellow, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.14,0:35:59.63,en,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just skedaddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.71,0:36:01.67,en,,0,0,0,,I can't skedaddle. My friends are being held down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.77,0:36:04.47,en,,0,0,0,,I got to go get them. I got to find another way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.55,0:36:17.02,en,,0,0,0,,This is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.36,0:36:26.39,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all right. I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.17,0:36:31.16,en,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's you they're afraid of, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.01,0:36:39.91,en,,0,0,0,,Trade you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.51,0:36:43.85,en,,0,0,0,,Back off! Just back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.05,0:36:46.68,en,,0,0,0,,I will fork you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.02,0:36:48.51,en,,0,0,0,,How about you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.36,0:36:53.05,en,,0,0,0,,Never send a boy to do a woman's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:55.86,en,,0,0,0,,I spent two weeks spear-hunting with a tribe in Micronesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.76,0:36:59.79,en,,0,0,0,,The Micronesians had much slower reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.54,0:37:04.83,en,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.48,0:37:14.21,en,,0,0,0,,It's over! It's over! It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.78,0:37:20.48,en,,0,0,0,,Well, this is one humdinger of a hootenanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.13,0:37:28.99,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:33.06,en,,0,0,0,,Wow, four bars in 1945.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.13,0:37:34.66,en,,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Dad, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.77,0:37:36.39,en,,0,0,0,,I've been studying these plans to the Archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.67,0:37:38.07,en,,0,0,0,,Looks like once you get down the stairwell...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:40.11,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm way past the stairwell, Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:42.30,en,,0,0,0,,- So you found everyone? - Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:44.27,en,,0,0,0,,What is that flibberty-widget you are talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:46.31,en,,0,0,0,,- Who's that? - It's Amelia Earhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.41,0:37:48.07,en,,0,0,0,,You found Amelia Earhart?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.15,0:37:49.31,en,,0,0,0,,I... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:53.28,en,,0,0,0,,- Wait a minute! - Buddy, what's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.35,0:37:56.58,en,,0,0,0,,- Didn't you hear? The war's over! - Sorry. These guys are chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.66,0:37:59.49,en,,0,0,0,,What? What am I looking at, Mardi Gras?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.59,0:38:02.93,en,,0,0,0,,- What unit are you from? - I'm from Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.00,0:38:07.30,en,,0,0,0,,What? Are you serious? I'm from Flatbush! Hey, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:09.59,en,,0,0,0,,These so-and-so's are trying to rough up my pal here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.67,0:38:11.00,en,,0,0,0,,just 'cause he's from Brooklyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.10,0:38:12.83,en,,0,0,0,,- Thank you! - You got it! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:18.27,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister! You forgot your...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:24.54,en,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.79,0:38:33.38,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Mind if I get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.96,0:38:39.86,en,,0,0,0,,Any time you're done, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.07,0:38:42.80,en,,0,0,0,,- Call me! - Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.87,0:38:45.00,en,,0,0,0,,So you're quite the smooth operator, aren't you, Mr. Daley?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.40,0:38:46.80,en,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:56.54,en,,0,0,0,,- That actually worked. - What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.65,0:38:59.08,en,,0,0,0,,Look, nothing personal, but I'm kind of in the middle of something here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.18,0:39:00.67,en,,0,0,0,,that's not really your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.75,0:39:02.48,en,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm a woman, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.69,0:39:06.25,en,,0,0,0,,No, it's because I've got this ancient raised-from-the-dead evil Pharaoh guy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.36,0:39:09.38,en,,0,0,0,,who's willing to kill me and probably anyone near me to get this tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:10.72,en,,0,0,0,,so he can rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.85,en,,0,0,0,,So it is because I'm a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.93,0:39:14.23,en,,0,0,0,,- Look, I... - No, you look, Mr. Daley!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.33,0:39:16.73,en,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for me, you'd still be lost in that monochromatic mayhem!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:19.20,en,,0,0,0,,- Lost in what? - Black and white photo, you boob!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.27,0:39:21.43,en,,0,0,0,,Now listen, and listen good. I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.54,0:39:24.53,en,,0,0,0,,I want to help you, and not because I like you, which so far I don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.61,0:39:28.21,en,,0,0,0,,but because I smell adventure, and, damn it, I want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.35,0:39:32.78,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Don't blame me if something happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:34.85,en,,0,0,0,,I should be so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.92,0:39:40.42,en,,0,0,0,,I am Kahmunrah. I am half god,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:43.69,en,,0,0,0,,once removed on my mother's side,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.76,0:39:48.29,en,,0,0,0,,rightful ruler of Egypt, future ruler of...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:50.86,en,,0,0,0,,Well, everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:54.03,en,,0,0,0,,Now, I have lost some men.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.64,0:39:59.70,en,,0,0,0,,So, I am in need of some new generals to join me in my little plan
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.78,0:40:01.77,en,,0,0,0,,of conquering this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.38,0:40:04.04,en,,0,0,0,,Ivan the Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.88,0:40:08.15,en,,0,0,0,,Napoleon Bonaparte.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.25,0:40:10.24,en,,0,0,0,,And young Al Capone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.38,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.46,0:40:17.26,en,,0,0,0,,Some of the most despicable, most feared leaders in all of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.06,0:40:19.43,en,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:23.57,en,,0,0,0,,really, it's just fantastic to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:25.13,en,,0,0,0,,- And us, too. - And me, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.57,0:40:30.51,en,,0,0,0,,All I ask is your allegiance, and in return, I offer you the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.04,en,,0,0,0,,Literally. Are there any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.15,0:40:36.05,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got one. How come you're wearing a dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.32,0:40:38.65,en,,0,0,0,,This is not a dress. This is a tunic.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.15,0:40:42.14,en,,0,0,0,,It was the height of fashion 3,000 years ago, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.55,0:40:43.99,en,,0,0,0,,Are there any other questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.06,0:40:47.79,en,,0,0,0,,Da. This dress you're wearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.86,0:40:50.12,en,,0,0,0,,do we have to wear one of these, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.53,0:40:54.16,en,,0,0,0,,Were you not listening? I just told Mr. Capone here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.23,0:40:55.86,en,,0,0,0,,that this is not a dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.97,0:40:59.63,en,,0,0,0,,It is, in fact, a tunic. Very big difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.51,0:41:02.50,en,,0,0,0,,Are there any other questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.48,en,,0,0,0,,Any questions not about the dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:07.58,en,,0,0,0,,Tunic?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.25,0:41:10.22,en,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Moonlight is wasting,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.32,0:41:12.34,en,,0,0,0,,- and the time is short. - Short?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:15.72,en,,0,0,0,,Why do you look at me when you say "short"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.46,0:41:19.19,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry. It slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.59,0:41:25.32,en,,0,0,0,,Da. If we are talking about world domination,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.40,0:41:27.23,en,,0,0,0,,then of course, I am interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:31.10,en,,0,0,0,,But first I want to clarify something so you know what you are getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:34.77,en,,0,0,0,,People always say, "Ivan the Terrible, he's so terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.87,0:41:37.57,en,,0,0,0,,"I'm so scared of Ivan. He's bad news."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.68,0:41:40.51,en,,0,0,0,,When in fact, the correct translation is
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.35,0:41:43.44,en,,0,0,0,,"Ivan the Awesome".
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.55,0:41:46.18,en,,0,0,0,,Ivan the Awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:48.84,en,,0,0,0,,It's not really as catchy, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:51.79,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, "Ivan the Terrible", that really pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:55.55,en,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't terrible. In fact, I was quite an effective leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.63,0:41:59.29,en,,0,0,0,,Duly noted. Now, I'd like to wrap up the old meet-and-greet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.40,0:42:01.73,en,,0,0,0,,by asking you gentlemen a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.80,0:42:04.10,en,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.54,0:42:06.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. Yeah, sure. - Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.27,0:42:10.87,en,,0,0,0,,- Da, but... - Then bring Larry Daley of Daley Devices
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:13.91,en,,0,0,0,,and the Golden Tablet of Ahkmenrah to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.55,en,,0,0,0,,We'll get you back down to your chums, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:22.21,en,,0,0,0,,You won't get lost following Amelia Earhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.39,0:42:24.79,en,,0,0,0,,Quick, get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.26,0:42:31.23,en,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Mr. Daley, I quite like the way you're holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.90,0:42:35.39,en,,0,0,0,,No. Sorry, I wasn't trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:37.46,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, stop beating your gums, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.57,0:42:39.80,en,,0,0,0,,You haven't been able to take your cheaters off my chassis
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.91,0:42:41.50,en,,0,0,0,,since the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.61,0:42:43.91,en,,0,0,0,,I literally didn't understand one word of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.58,0:42:51.14,en,,0,0,0,,Is it just me or is there music in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.25,0:42:55.78,en,,0,0,0,,∮ ... my baby, we can make it shine We can take forever... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.85,0:42:58.69,en,,0,0,0,,You! Little flying angel things! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.79,0:43:01.32,en,,0,0,0,,They're cupids, Mr. Daley. Gods of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.43,0:43:05.12,en,,0,0,0,,Great. Gods of love, would you shut up? Please shut up. We're trying to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.37,0:43:09.06,en,,0,0,0,,∮ Yeah! More than a woman! Yeah! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.67,0:43:14.37,en,,0,0,0,,No, don't change the arrangement, it's not about the arrangement. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.01,0:43:16.37,en,,0,0,0,,Kick the chorus, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.48,0:43:18.10,en,,0,0,0,,∮ More than a woman ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.44,0:43:20.47,en,,0,0,0,,Yo, show me what you got, night guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.55,0:43:21.88,en,,0,0,0,,All right, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.98,0:43:24.61,en,,0,0,0,,∮ More than a woman to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.52,0:43:27.18,en,,0,0,0,,∮ More than a woman ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.29,0:43:29.62,en,,0,0,0,,∮ She's more than a woman ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.19,0:43:41.00,en,,0,0,0,,And so, the little tiny man who could not be a smaller or shorter mouse
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.07,0:43:43.83,en,,0,0,0,,runs into the claws of the giant cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.24,0:43:46.67,en,,0,0,0,,You're really hung up on the height, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.74,0:43:48.57,en,,0,0,0,,- No, it's not about height, see... - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.64,0:43:50.67,en,,0,0,0,,You're saying I'm a little mouse, you're a giant cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.74,0:43:53.73,en,,0,0,0,,- I am the giant cat. - No offense, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.85,0:43:56.75,en,,0,0,0,,You're Napoleon. There's a complex named after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.85,0:43:58.94,en,,0,0,0,,You're famous for being little, and it's true. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.05,0:44:01.61,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, you naive American man-boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:04.59,en,,0,0,0,,Look. Neither of us are gonna be jamming anytime soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.69,0:44:07.02,en,,0,0,0,,So it's not like we should... It's not even an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.09,0:44:11.62,en,,0,0,0,,It's not about height or something else. It's a plan. It's a brilliant plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:14.79,en,,0,0,0,,- So it was a plan. - Snazzy maneuver, Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.04,0:44:18.50,en,,0,0,0,,Merci, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.57,0:44:21.73,en,,0,0,0,,Now, if your boyfriend would kindly come with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.81,0:44:23.21,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.21,0:44:26.91,en,,0,0,0,,- Not her boyfriend. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.21,0:44:28.70,en,,0,0,0,,Just friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.25,0:44:35.38,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, friends. - Acquaintances. Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.82,0:44:39.48,en,,0,0,0,,Were you guys, like, friends in college
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.59,0:44:42.06,en,,0,0,0,,and just afraid now to both ruin your relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.13,0:44:44.49,en,,0,0,0,,by telling the other person that you want to be more than friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.60,0:44:46.12,en,,0,0,0,,that you like-like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.67,0:44:51.76,en,,0,0,0,,One more time? I'm sorry. I didn't catch the...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.67,0:44:54.30,en,,0,0,0,,Were you guys, like, friends in college
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.41,0:44:56.24,en,,0,0,0,,and now both afraid to ruin your relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.31,0:44:59.07,en,,0,0,0,,by telling the other person that you want to be more than friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.14,0:45:01.17,en,,0,0,0,,that you like-like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.92,0:45:05.68,en,,0,0,0,,- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.78,0:45:08.84,en,,0,0,0,,I just love the nitty-gritty of relationships. All us French do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.95,0:45:10.51,en,,0,0,0,,- Great. - Yes. Amour!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:11.85,en,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.96,0:45:14.26,en,,0,0,0,,- This way, or you die. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.63,0:45:22.00,en,,0,0,0,,- Wait, I'm coming with you! - No! Our fight is not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:29.30,en,,0,0,0,,- so you gotta bet a second time. - All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:33.91,en,,0,0,0,,My hair is currency in certain parts of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.01,0:45:37.07,en,,0,0,0,,It's true. Currency, like gold or paper money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.75,0:45:40.08,en,,0,0,0,,The Duomo was purchased with just one locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.22,0:45:41.55,en,,0,0,0,,Listen up, kemosabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:45.49,en,,0,0,0,,This rodeo clown wouldn't know a flapjack from a flyswatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:47.86,en,,0,0,0,,Now, Gigantor's out there risking his hide for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.93,0:45:49.89,en,,0,0,0,,The least we can do is give him some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:54.66,en,,0,0,0,,Some big help. But we can't very well do that if we're stuck in here, now, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.73,0:45:57.10,en,,0,0,0,,We need to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.20,0:45:59.36,en,,0,0,0,,What's a flapjack?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.44,0:46:01.87,en,,0,0,0,,It's like a biscuit or a scone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.94,0:46:04.34,en,,0,0,0,,- Chest bump? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.41,0:46:07.17,en,,0,0,0,,Then deadly. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.58,0:46:10.28,en,,0,0,0,,Guard your cards, okay? Now you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.85,0:46:12.94,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you got to throw some cards down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.42,0:46:17.29,en,,0,0,0,,- Ready? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.62,0:46:21.56,en,,0,0,0,,Say something. Say anything. This is no fun. You're supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.80,0:46:26.20,en,,0,0,0,,- Hey! What are you two doing out here? - Octavius, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.26,0:46:29.39,en,,0,0,0,,- You, make a run for it, I'll hold them off! - I will not leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:32.73,en,,0,0,0,,Ain't no time for your Roman melodrama! Now, get! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.21,0:46:34.70,en,,0,0,0,,Old Jedediah will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:36.07,en,,0,0,0,,Now, you're in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.78,0:46:43.41,en,,0,0,0,,Why, these aren't real rubies at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.15,0:46:45.98,en,,0,0,0,,Ruby slippers indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.89,0:46:53.88,en,,0,0,0,,But, whoever you are, Archie Bunker, you had one comfortable throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.89,0:46:56.22,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.29,0:46:59.56,en,,0,0,0,,Caught this one trying to escape through a rust hole in the crate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.63,0:47:01.46,en,,0,0,0,,One of his little friends got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.57,0:47:05.09,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, please. What damage could they possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.17,0:47:09.11,en,,0,0,0,,Why, they're no bigger than a little grain of couscous. Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.17,0:47:11.40,en,,0,0,0,,You know, two words come to mind when I hear you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.81,0:47:13.94,en,,0,0,0,,"Delusional" and "weirdo".
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.51,0:47:17.88,en,,0,0,0,,And if I had to say a third, "goofy". Just goofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:21.88,en,,0,0,0,,Now you let old Jedediah out of here or he's gonna get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.29,0:47:23.88,en,,0,0,0,,Well played, Jedediah!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:27.69,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't take you seriously. You're just adorable,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.19,0:47:30.39,en,,0,0,0,,even when you're threatening me. It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.50,0:47:34.63,en,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or are these guys unbelievably cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.70,0:47:35.83,en,,0,0,0,,Now hold it a second, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.90,0:47:38.63,en,,0,0,0,,Now, you have a right to keep me as your captive, torture me, even,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.70,0:47:41.14,en,,0,0,0,,but don't call me cute! I ain't cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.21,0:47:46.23,en,,0,0,0,,Steady, my friend! Just stay alive! I will find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.35,0:47:53.51,en,,0,0,0,,Gigantor. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.15,0:47:58.38,en,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Daley. Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.83,0:48:03.59,en,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind, I shall take that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:05.56,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.70,0:48:11.16,en,,0,0,0,,Finally. Finally! After 3,000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.67,0:48:18.37,en,,0,0,0,,my evil army of the damned, my beautiful, beautiful army,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.44,0:48:23.21,en,,0,0,0,,shall be unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.36,0:48:34.35,en,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that Mother and Father may have
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.43,0:48:37.36,en,,0,0,0,,slightly changed the combination on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.90,0:48:40.87,en,,0,0,0,,I guess this whole unleashing-the-underworld thing
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.93,0:48:43.20,en,,0,0,0,,isn't really working out for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.27,0:48:46.47,en,,0,0,0,,It must be really frustrating, 'cause you've waited thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.57,0:48:48.37,en,,0,0,0,,to come back from the dead and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:51.81,en,,0,0,0,,and now you can't get it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.54,0:48:55.78,en,,0,0,0,,Fear not, for I shall wait a thousand more if I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.88,0:48:59.94,en,,0,0,0,,Good, 'cause in a few hours you'll be standing here in a frustrated position,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.05,0:49:03.65,en,,0,0,0,,frozen, and I'll walk out of here with my buddies and that'll be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.76,0:49:04.88,en,,0,0,0,,So, I got all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.46,0:49:08.55,en,,0,0,0,,Really? All night? Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.09,0:49:10.58,en,,0,0,0,,He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:21.80,en,,0,0,0,,Open that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.91,0:49:24.97,en,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - No touching! No touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.08,0:49:26.51,en,,0,0,0,,Don't you manhandle me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.95,0:49:29.74,en,,0,0,0,,- Look, he's having a little tantrum. - Jed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.08,0:49:34.11,en,,0,0,0,,Don't you squirm! Don't squirm. It'll only be worse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.19,0:49:36.42,en,,0,0,0,,- Put him down! - Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.49,0:49:38.08,en,,0,0,0,,I shan't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.12,0:49:40.49,en,,0,0,0,,I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.83,0:49:45.19,en,,0,0,0,,I don't think he has all night at all, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.76,0:49:50.03,en,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, I'd say he has a little over an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.14,0:49:51.76,en,,0,0,0,,Take me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.54,0:49:57.60,en,,0,0,0,,You were the guardian! You know all about this tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:50:00.87,en,,0,0,0,,You're obviously much more clever than the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.95,0:50:03.04,en,,0,0,0,,You may or may not know the combination,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.15,0:50:06.41,en,,0,0,0,,but I am going to give you exactly one hour to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:09.45,en,,0,0,0,,If you do not, I shall kill your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:13.48,en,,0,0,0,,And please don't think about escaping, for I shall be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.56,0:50:15.36,en,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't even know how to begin
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.46,0:50:17.62,en,,0,0,0,,to decipher this thing, all right? Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.70,0:50:19.32,en,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.40,0:50:23.23,en,,0,0,0,,And your little cowboy friend seemed like such a charming little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.57,0:50:29.47,en,,0,0,0,,Ah, well. Tick-tock, Mr. Daley. Your hour has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.54,0:50:34.34,en,,0,0,0,,Hey! You got this, partner. I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.49,0:50:44.72,en,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.60,0:50:55.09,en,,0,0,0,,There you are! Are you all right? I've been worried sick! Sick I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.17,0:50:57.96,en,,0,0,0,,- No, I'm fine. - So what's our next move, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.04,0:51:00.70,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I just got to get this tablet translated.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.17,0:51:03.77,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, great! This guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.84,0:51:06.68,en,,0,0,0,,Look, buddy, we don't want any trouble, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.79,0:51:19.12,en,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.22,0:51:22.75,en,,0,0,0,,I guess our sassy cephalopod was just a fish who didn't like being out of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.63,0:51:25.60,en,,0,0,0,,He's not such a ballywagger after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.60,0:51:31.97,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Glad you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.35,0:51:43.64,en,,0,0,0,,Hello? A little assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.48,0:51:46.47,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Teddy! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.58,0:51:47.71,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.79,0:51:49.38,en,,0,0,0,,I'd love to help you, but first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.45,0:51:51.79,en,,0,0,0,,My nose is so itchy, it's driving me insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.89,0:51:55.16,en,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, but, as you see, I'm missing a few body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.26,0:51:58.46,en,,0,0,0,,- Could you please give us a scratch? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.43,0:52:02.46,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! That's exquisite. A little over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.57,0:52:03.76,en,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - More?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.84,0:52:06.10,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Yes! Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.81,0:52:09.33,en,,0,0,0,,Sweet rutabaga pie, that was divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.84,0:52:11.40,en,,0,0,0,,Theodore Roosevelt, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.78,0:52:14.34,en,,0,0,0,,Twenty-sixth President of the United States, Rough Rider,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:16.47,en,,0,0,0,,founder of the national parks, and a whole bunch of other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.92,0:52:20.61,en,,0,0,0,,- Have we met? - No, there's another Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.69,0:52:25.25,en,,0,0,0,,- We have one of you in New York. - Really? What's he like, this other me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.46,0:52:28.59,en,,0,0,0,,He's pretty much the same, except with...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.66,0:52:30.75,en,,0,0,0,,Except what? Say it. Except with a body?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.83,0:52:33.26,en,,0,0,0,,- Yes. He has a body. - Oh, dash it, the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.87,0:52:35.70,en,,0,0,0,,- And a horse. - Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.80,0:52:38.43,en,,0,0,0,,We really need someone to translate what's written on this tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.84,0:52:42.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Do you read hieroglyphics? - Yes, I do, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.14,0:52:43.87,en,,0,0,0,,That's a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.98,0:52:48.00,en,,0,0,0,,Bird. Man with spear. Sideways fish. Beetle. Vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.88,0:52:50.71,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, and what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.82,0:52:53.88,en,,0,0,0,,It means, and this is just a rough translation,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.79,0:52:58.88,en,,0,0,0,,"A man with a spear trapped a bird and a sideways fish in a vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.23,0:53:02.89,en,,0,0,0,,"And there was also a beetle."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.96,0:53:07.93,en,,0,0,0,,- I don't think that's it. - That's just one possible translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.00,0:53:09.52,en,,0,0,0,,Another possible translation is,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:11.57,en,,0,0,0,,"You will find the combination you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.64,0:53:15.47,en,,0,0,0,,"if you figure out the secret at the heart of Pharaoh's tomb."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.87,0:53:18.71,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay, and what does that mean? - I don't know! What am I, the Sphinx?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.78,0:53:21.01,en,,0,0,0,,"What's this? What's that?" Why don't you ask New York Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:23.48,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'd love to get his grabby little fingers all over that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:25.18,en,,0,0,0,,Probably let his horse lick it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.25,0:53:27.65,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Daley, we should be going to the sculpture gallery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.72,0:53:29.88,en,,0,0,0,,I think there's someone there who might have a better thought on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.66,0:53:32.62,en,,0,0,0,,The fellow we're looking for is just down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.69,0:53:36.02,en,,0,0,0,,- Bonsoir. - Hello, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.53,0:53:39.59,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, excuse me. Could we keep moving, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:42.72,en,,0,0,0,,We certainly could, but then we might miss a rare opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.83,0:53:45.36,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, she is a Degas, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.44,0:53:47.60,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's just I got a little buddy stuck in an hourglass,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.71,0:53:49.43,en,,0,0,0,,I got a pitch meeting at Wal-Mart in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.54,0:53:52.91,en,,0,0,0,,- It would be great if we could... - He's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.78,0:53:55.44,en,,0,0,0,,I think he'll have a thought on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.78,0:53:58.68,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Thinker, we're sorry to interrupt your contemplation,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.75,0:54:03.18,en,,0,0,0,,but we really need to figure out the secret at the heart of Pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.25,0:54:06.42,en,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking. I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.89,0:54:09.42,en,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.36,0:54:14.80,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm thinking. - It's not happening with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.50,0:54:16.83,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.27,en,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me. Check that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.61,0:54:24.23,en,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.31,0:54:25.97,en,,0,0,0,,Buddy! Over here! This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:27.88,en,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.28,0:54:30.11,en,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what's a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.22,0:54:31.91,en,,0,0,0,,That beautiful lady over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.98,0:54:35.44,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby! Check out the gun show going on over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.96,0:54:38.48,en,,0,0,0,,Firepower!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.89,0:54:40.95,en,,0,0,0,,He's certainly no Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.06,0:54:43.89,en,,0,0,0,,- Biceps! Deltoids... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.96,0:54:47.23,en,,0,0,0,,- Wait a minute. I saw a bunch of those. - A bunch of whats?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.30,0:54:49.10,en,,0,0,0,,- Little Einsteins. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.13,0:54:52.13,en,,0,0,0,,Over there, in Air and Space.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.00,0:54:54.73,en,,0,0,0,,I gotta get over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.27,0:54:56.40,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.47,0:54:59.97,en,,0,0,0,,- Nothing. - Okay. Then why are you staring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:02.31,en,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna miss a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.41,0:55:04.75,en,,0,0,0,,All right, good, but we should get going, 'cause we...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.92,0:55:08.39,en,,0,0,0,,- Why? - You talk too much, ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.42,0:55:14.82,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I did that, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.93,0:55:18.02,en,,0,0,0,,I just feel as if I've been asleep for a long time and now, suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.43,0:55:19.66,en,,0,0,0,,I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.93,0:55:21.80,en,,0,0,0,,I can explain that...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.67,0:55:24.43,en,,0,0,0,,But really, I could. I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.30,0:55:26.86,en,,0,0,0,,Again, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.11,0:55:33.44,en,,0,0,0,,Great, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.05,0:55:40.45,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yeah. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.52,0:55:43.61,en,,0,0,0,,Love theme from Titanic. Good, but not really appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.46,0:55:50.19,en,,0,0,0,,You don't let yourself enjoy things much, do you, Mr. Daley?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.36,0:55:54.26,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, you know what? It's not really the song choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.33,0:55:56.20,en,,0,0,0,,And by the way, you're a little pitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:59.36,en,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought you were amazing, and you look wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.04,0:56:02.94,en,,0,0,0,,Could you just fly away, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.78,0:56:05.54,en,,0,0,0,,And so the adventure continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.51,0:56:11.71,en,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you? Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.92,0:56:24.19,en,,0,0,0,,You know, I do sort of feel like a floating butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.63,0:56:27.12,en,,0,0,0,,You are crazier than a road lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.23,0:56:31.26,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Egypt, these two here heard that we're taking over the world
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.37,0:56:34.30,en,,0,0,0,,and they want in. I don't know who they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.41,0:56:37.77,en,,0,0,0,,but they're on exhibit here, too, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.64,0:56:40.80,en,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.91,0:56:46.04,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we're all full up in our axis of evil today. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.12,0:56:49.28,en,,0,0,0,,Come on! But I'm bad! I'm bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.39,0:56:51.88,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, I could show you how bad I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:54.99,en,,0,0,0,,Fear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.10,0:56:58.76,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm just not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.83,0:57:03.27,en,,0,0,0,,You don't seem very bad. You just seem sort of vaguely grouchy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.17,0:57:05.57,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.27,0:57:09.93,en,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? What is that? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.01,0:57:12.27,en,,0,0,0,,What does it mean? You've lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.34,0:57:16.01,en,,0,0,0,,Is that you breathing? Because I can't hear myself think.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.75,0:57:19.77,en,,0,0,0,,Can I make one suggestion to you, my friend? Just simplify.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.85,0:57:22.29,en,,0,0,0,,There's just too much going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.35,0:57:26.85,en,,0,0,0,,You're evil, you're asthmatic, you're a robot... And what is the cape for?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.96,0:57:29.52,en,,0,0,0,,Are we going to the opera? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.63,0:57:31.75,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.83,0:57:33.35,en,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.46,0:57:35.33,en,,0,0,0,,He's leaving with the tablet!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.03,0:57:37.59,en,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.94,0:57:40.37,en,,0,0,0,,Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.94,0:57:44.97,en,,0,0,0,,He's not trying to figure out the... He's trying to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.04,0:57:49.10,en,,0,0,0,,Go. Go! All of you! Kill him! And bring me that tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.35,0:57:52.87,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, people! Let's go! Without that tablet, we've nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.98,0:57:54.71,en,,0,0,0,,Streltsy! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.32,0:58:00.72,en,,0,0,0,,Thought you could get away, didn't you, Larry Daley?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.17,0:58:10.73,en,,0,0,0,,Criminy, we're jimmy-jacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.84,0:58:12.96,en,,0,0,0,,- Jimmy-jacked? Really? - It's the way I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.04,0:58:15.30,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, but that one sounds made up, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.37,0:58:19.47,en,,0,0,0,,"Oh, no, our path has been blocked by bad people." What's the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.64,0:58:22.31,en,,0,0,0,,The point is, we're not getting into the Air and Space right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:24.41,en,,0,0,0,,- You're right. We are jimmy-jacked. - Jimmy-jacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:26.25,en,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.23,0:58:38.56,en,,0,0,0,,They say a good man rules this union.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.16,0:58:41.50,en,,0,0,0,,I promised Jedediah I would bring help,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.03,0:58:44.00,en,,0,0,0,,and help I will bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:50.84,en,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.86,0:59:05.76,en,,0,0,0,,Misjudged the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.63,0:59:11.06,en,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.93,0:59:18.56,en,,0,0,0,,Jupiter, protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.31,0:59:26.33,en,,0,0,0,,Remain very still.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:29.38,en,,0,0,0,,They can sense movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.98,0:59:34.32,en,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they can also hear me talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:38.55,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.22,0:59:41.82,en,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.73,0:59:50.79,en,,0,0,0,,We should be okay in here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:58.10,en,,0,0,0,,So, how long have you guarded antiquities?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.18,1:00:00.84,en,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, no, I don't actually work at the...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.95,1:00:02.74,en,,0,0,0,,I just thought with the fancy getup and all...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.45,1:00:04.94,en,,0,0,0,,No, I borrowed this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.45,1:00:09.98,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was a guard back in New York, but that was a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.76,1:00:14.02,en,,0,0,0,,So why did you leave? Did you not enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.13,1:00:15.75,en,,0,0,0,,No, I loved it. I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.83,1:00:18.69,en,,0,0,0,,Things sort of took off in a different direction, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.80,1:00:22.25,en,,0,0,0,,- So what do you do now? - Well, I sort of...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:26.00,en,,0,0,0,,Well, I sort of design products and sell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.44,1:00:28.20,en,,0,0,0,,- You're an inventor! - I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.31,1:00:30.17,en,,0,0,0,,I am an inventor, yeah. I invent stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.44,1:00:31.97,en,,0,0,0,,Like the rocket ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.04,1:00:33.70,en,,0,0,0,,- No. - The sea plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.81,1:00:36.61,en,,0,0,0,,- The dirigible? - No, not aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.68,1:00:39.48,en,,0,0,0,,Sort of like more small-scale stuff, like...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.82,1:00:43.78,en,,0,0,0,,Well, the Glow-in-the-Dark Flashlight, that was mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.79,1:00:47.49,en,,0,0,0,,So this new job, do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.06,1:00:51.65,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like it a lot. It's exciting. It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.30,1:00:55.56,en,,0,0,0,,- What? - I'm just confused, is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.67,1:00:57.86,en,,0,0,0,,If you're not excited by it, why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.37,1:01:02.07,en,,0,0,0,,- I am excited by it. I just said... - I know what you said, Mr. Daley,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.17,1:01:05.51,en,,0,0,0,,but what I see in front of me is a man who's lost his moxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.81,1:01:08.97,en,,0,0,0,,I have not lost my...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.31,1:01:11.14,en,,0,0,0,,I got my moxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.48,1:01:13.01,en,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I became a pilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.69,1:01:17.55,en,,0,0,0,,- I don't, no. - For the fun of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:20.56,en,,0,0,0,,Why else would anyone do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.20,1:01:25.75,en,,0,0,0,,Great Gatsby!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.26,1:01:30.83,en,,0,0,0,,Blast these pigeons and their incessant cooing!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.90,1:01:33.84,en,,0,0,0,,- No! Mr. President! Sir! - All right. Time to see the state...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.90,1:01:37.17,en,,0,0,0,,- Please don't get up! - of this great union! I always say,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.24,1:01:40.94,en,,0,0,0,,leave nothing for tomorrow which can be done today.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.05,1:01:43.07,en,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you go out there, you're gonna freak a lot of people out!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.18,1:01:46.95,en,,0,0,0,,Freak? I assure you, sir, I am no freak.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.05,1:01:51.45,en,,0,0,0,,- No, I didn't mean you're a freak... - Come here, little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.36,1:01:55.59,en,,0,0,0,,In fact, if anyone is freakish, I'm afraid it's you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.09,1:01:58.93,en,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you are very small.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.03,1:02:01.73,en,,0,0,0,,And I mean even for a regular-sized human.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:04.56,en,,0,0,0,,What? Why would you even say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.87,1:02:07.03,en,,0,0,0,,I must be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.10,1:02:10.47,en,,0,0,0,,Right. Okay, Honest Abe. Of course. I'm sorry. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.57,1:02:12.87,en,,0,0,0,,Come, now, Mr. President, put the little man down
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.94,1:02:15.21,en,,0,0,0,,and let's sit our fanny back in that throne of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.28,1:02:18.77,en,,0,0,0,,You have a can-do attitude, and I shall do as you ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.88,1:02:20.48,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:22.65,en,,0,0,0,,- There you go. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.75,1:02:27.16,en,,0,0,0,,It's that very can-do spirit that has defined this remarkable nation of ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.26,1:02:28.75,en,,0,0,0,,- Interesting story. - They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.83,1:02:30.12,en,,0,0,0,,One night in Gettysburg...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.23,1:02:31.96,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we're gonna need you to hold still now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.06,1:02:33.79,en,,0,0,0,,- What? - Abraham, freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.90,1:02:35.66,en,,0,0,0,,Freeze? I...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.94,1:02:45.00,en,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.11,1:02:47.60,en,,0,0,0,,- Come on, let's get to Air and Space. - If I may,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.68,1:02:51.11,en,,0,0,0,,- you two make an adorable couple. - Oh, no, we're not...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:52.84,en,,0,0,0,,No, we're not a... I mean, we're not a...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.95,1:02:56.15,en,,0,0,0,,"We're not a... I mean, we're not a..."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.25,1:02:57.78,en,,0,0,0,,I never lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.12,1:03:01.65,en,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you two are adorable together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.76,1:03:03.19,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.29,1:03:08.76,en,,0,0,0,,Farewell, lovely lady and small, little man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.30,1:03:12.97,en,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if we can find these Einsteins of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.42,1:03:32.89,en,,0,0,0,,One giant leap for a mannequin...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.59,1:03:38.59,en,,0,0,0,,D.C., this is Air and Space. We are back online and fully operational.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.70,1:03:47.76,en,,0,0,0,,The Tuskegee Airmen are on the march once again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.84,1:03:51.83,en,,0,0,0,,Can you stop narrating everything we're doing? Just live in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.38,1:03:55.47,en,,0,0,0,,The Tuskegee Airmen are living in the moment!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.55,1:03:56.98,en,,0,0,0,,- Miss Earhart? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:03:59.21,en,,0,0,0,,- I wanna say thank you. - What for, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.32,1:04:01.58,en,,0,0,0,,A lot of people didn't think we could fly, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.69,1:04:03.85,en,,0,0,0,,Thanks for clearing the runway, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.36,1:04:09.59,en,,0,0,0,,- Race you to Paris? - You're on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.69,1:04:11.02,en,,0,0,0,,No! Not now! We gotta...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.10,1:04:13.36,en,,0,0,0,,- It's just a quick jaunt over the pond. - No. Gotta find the Einsteins.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.43,1:04:16.52,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta go. We don't have time. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:18.93,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's in the blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.67,1:04:21.26,en,,0,0,0,,There she is, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.37,1:04:25.00,en,,0,0,0,,Old Bessie, the old family bus. That gal took me across the Atlantic!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.08,1:04:27.04,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. I think the Einsteins are over here, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:29.81,en,,0,0,0,,This is Mission Control. Flight check complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.88,1:04:32.37,en,,0,0,0,,- Where'd you go? Where'd they go? - You are clear for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.45,1:04:33.92,en,,0,0,0,,Contact!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.02,1:04:35.92,en,,0,0,0,,D.C., this is Mission Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.69,1:04:39.78,en,,0,0,0,,- No, no! No! - All systems go and green for lift-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.89,1:04:42.36,en,,0,0,0,,Roger that. We are green for lift-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.43,1:04:45.19,en,,0,0,0,,No, we're definitely not green for any kind of lift-off!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.26,1:04:49.06,en,,0,0,0,,- I want a "go, no-go" for launch. - I say no-go. Let's not go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.13,1:04:50.23,en,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.80,1:04:52.27,en,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.04,1:04:55.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Go! - No! No go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.61,1:04:57.30,en,,0,0,0,,Torquing angles incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.41,1:04:59.47,en,,0,0,0,,Tone it down with the torque. Torque it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.58,1:05:01.14,en,,0,0,0,,De-torque. De-torque.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.05,1:05:04.88,en,,0,0,0,,Commence ignition sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.95,1:05:07.47,en,,0,0,0,,- Roger that, flight. - We have launch commit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.59,1:05:09.75,en,,0,0,0,,- No. No, no, no! - Ten,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.82,1:05:12.08,en,,0,0,0,,nine, eight, seven...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.16,1:05:14.25,en,,0,0,0,,- Hey, that's mine. - No, we do not have commit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.33,1:05:17.26,en,,0,0,0,,Repeat. We are decommissioning the committal of the launch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.33,1:05:22.99,en,,0,0,0,,and it is now a negatory launch phase. We are in a no-fly, no-go phase.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.10,1:05:27.80,en,,0,0,0,,That is a November-Gorgon phase of non-flying!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.91,1:05:29.77,en,,0,0,0,,- Fine! - And we're gonna say good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.84,1:05:32.37,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Good work. Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.74,1:05:35.68,en,,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - Damn, that was disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.75,1:05:37.71,en,,0,0,0,,Come on. I'll buy you a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.45,1:05:40.18,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, little space monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.19,1:05:46.12,en,,0,0,0,,You're Able. Okay, good. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.76,1:05:48.62,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, good. At ease. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.49,1:05:52.86,en,,0,0,0,,You're a polite little fella, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.96,1:05:56.09,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, you happen to know where those little Einstein bobblehead guys are?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.40,1:05:59.87,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Daley! I found your Einsteins.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.54,1:06:01.80,en,,0,0,0,,Great. Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.87,1:06:05.50,en,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, we're trying to crack the combination of this tablet doodad,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.61,1:06:08.10,en,,0,0,0,,and the writing here says we'll find it
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.18,1:06:11.64,en,,0,0,0,,if we figure out the secret at the heart of Pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.65,1:06:16.48,en,,0,0,0,,That's an easy one. The answer's in the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.99,1:06:18.82,en,,0,0,0,,- What does that mean? - "Figure out".
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.89,1:06:21.48,en,,0,0,0,,It's a figure! I.e., a number.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.56,1:06:24.39,en,,0,0,0,,And the Pharaoh's tomb, i.e. The pyramids.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.50,1:06:27.06,en,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it, kid? You're looking for the secret number
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.16,1:06:29.03,en,,0,0,0,,at the heart of the pyramids.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.53,1:06:31.83,en,,0,0,0,,Well, whistle me Dixie, the answer's pi!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.17,1:06:35.73,en,,0,0,0,,- Pi? - 3.14159265, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.84,1:06:38.90,en,,0,0,0,,Yes! 3.1495265.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.01,1:06:42.07,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, 3.14159265.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:44.24,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, 3.14...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.92,1:06:47.35,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't tell. Is it yes or no? Cause you just...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.42,1:06:49.15,en,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard, could you just...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.22,1:06:50.55,en,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.65,1:06:54.22,en,,0,0,0,,- Sorry, I can't tell if it's up or... - I'm a bobblehead, dummkopf,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.33,1:06:57.49,en,,0,0,0,,and that's the way we like it. All together, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.56,1:07:01.59,en,,0,0,0,,That's the way We like it
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.70,1:07:03.69,en,,0,0,0,,You know, we can't all be Einsteins, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.77,1:07:04.93,en,,0,0,0,,- I can! - We are!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.04,1:07:06.56,en,,0,0,0,,- He is! - Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.67,1:07:08.43,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay, all right. - Okay, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.54,1:07:11.01,en,,0,0,0,,- Can you slow it down a little bit? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.24,en,,0,0,0,,3.14159265.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.35,1:07:16.84,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay. 3.14... - I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.45,1:07:19.38,en,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Mr. Einsteins. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.68,1:07:26.21,en,,0,0,0,,All right. Now, like the brilliant and famous general that I am,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.29,1:07:28.38,en,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard about what you said,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.46,1:07:32.45,en,,0,0,0,,and I've come up with a brand-new and improved battle plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.90,1:07:36.26,en,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.53,1:07:41.53,en,,0,0,0,,I will loudly announce that we are not
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.61,1:07:44.47,en,,0,0,0,,going to attack, and then...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.38,1:07:46.81,en,,0,0,0,,Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.91,1:07:52.04,en,,0,0,0,,"What's the amazing Custer about to say now? I hope he's my friend, or..."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.72,1:07:54.21,en,,0,0,0,,We attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.82,1:08:01.42,en,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect your friend to run off like that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.79,1:08:04.12,en,,0,0,0,,He's coming back, Ka-Ka-Ro.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.23,1:08:07.99,en,,0,0,0,,Sure as moon shines on a mongoose, he'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.27,1:08:11.29,en,,0,0,0,,I would save my breath if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.40,1:08:13.56,en,,0,0,0,,You don't have many left.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.61,1:08:19.08,en,,0,0,0,,We've got about 10 minutes to get over there to Jed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.14,1:08:21.98,en,,0,0,0,,I think we make a good team, perhaps more than a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.08,1:08:24.07,en,,0,0,0,,Wait. Okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.15,1:08:25.84,en,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You didn't like kissing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.95,1:08:29.85,en,,0,0,0,,No, I did. It was great. I mean, the slapping hurt a little bit, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.95,1:08:34.32,en,,0,0,0,,- So you don't like me, then. - Of course I like you. You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.43,1:08:36.76,en,,0,0,0,,I think you're an amazing person. You're...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.83,1:08:40.76,en,,0,0,0,,It's just there are certain issues that would prevent us from...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.83,1:08:45.10,en,,0,0,0,,- I just... You're not... - I'm not what, Mr. Daley?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.94,1:08:50.93,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. You're made of...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.28,1:08:53.64,en,,0,0,0,,Made of...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.22,1:09:06.85,en,,0,0,0,,Wonderful things. You're made of good, wonderful things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.90,1:09:14.06,en,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.54,1:09:20.87,en,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, could you buy us some time please?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.21,1:09:28.54,en,,0,0,0,,It'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.08,1:09:32.88,en,,0,0,0,,No! That's the first plane ever made!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.98,1:09:35.65,en,,0,0,0,,It's made out of balsa wood and paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.72,1:09:39.25,en,,0,0,0,,It's made out of spruce and canvas and good old-fashioned American ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.39,1:09:41.86,en,,0,0,0,,Are you coming, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.40,1:09:49.83,en,,0,0,0,,- Out of our way! - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.57,1:09:52.90,en,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.04,1:10:00.20,en,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Mr. Daley. Things are about to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.68,1:10:09.95,en,,0,0,0,,A lady pilot! Preposterous!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.09,1:10:13.35,en,,0,0,0,,- Think again, boys! - Oh, she's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.11,1:10:33.04,en,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.11,1:10:35.27,en,,0,0,0,,One of the wires is jammed. I'm going to have to loosen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.38,1:10:37.57,en,,0,0,0,,- Here, take the stick! - No! I'm not gonna... No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:39.21,en,,0,0,0,,I know you've got moxie in you yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.28,1:10:42.88,en,,0,0,0,,Moxie doesn't fly planes! People who have pilots' licenses fly planes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:44.48,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay. - She's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:48.89,en,,0,0,0,,I don't want it! I don't want the stick!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.76,1:10:55.43,en,,0,0,0,,Don't look now, Mr. Daley, but you're flying an airplane!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:08.64,en,,0,0,0,,Able! The doors!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.00,1:11:27.59,en,,0,0,0,,- Got it! - Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.83,1:11:32.20,en,,0,0,0,,Pull up!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.31,1:11:39.43,en,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.51,1:11:41.20,en,,0,0,0,,Godspeed, Amelia Earhart!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.31,1:11:42.71,en,,0,0,0,,Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.35,1:12:23.65,en,,0,0,0,,Look a little nervous there, Ramen Noodle.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.72,1:12:25.92,en,,0,0,0,,'Cause for me, this is like a spa treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.32,1:12:30.52,en,,0,0,0,,Sand baths are really rejuvenating for the skin. Exfoliates.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.26,1:12:32.66,en,,0,0,0,,Giving up yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.83,1:12:34.66,en,,0,0,0,,Not quite yet, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.33,1:12:39.46,en,,0,0,0,,In fact, let's see if we can't make time fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.44,1:12:47.10,en,,0,0,0,,What is that funny sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.87,1:13:10.46,en,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.64,1:13:14.04,en,,0,0,0,,Right there, please, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.54,1:13:16.23,en,,0,0,0,,Well. Well, well, well!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.31,1:13:18.80,en,,0,0,0,,You certainly know how to make an entrance, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.91,1:13:20.31,en,,0,0,0,,Time to recruit some backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.41,1:13:22.88,en,,0,0,0,,I hope for your little friend's sake, here,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.95,1:13:25.31,en,,0,0,0,,that you also figured out the combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.42,1:13:26.94,en,,0,0,0,,- Give me Jed. - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.05,1:13:29.78,en,,0,0,0,,First, give me the combination and hand over that tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.89,1:13:31.48,en,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the tablet and the combination
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.59,1:13:33.25,en,,0,0,0,,when you release my friends and give him back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.39,1:13:37.22,en,,0,0,0,,I shall release what I want to release the moment I want to release it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.29,1:13:38.92,en,,0,0,0,,Great. And I'll release what I want to release
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.00,1:13:40.72,en,,0,0,0,,at the exact moment that I want to release it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.80,1:13:43.49,en,,0,0,0,,Tell me the combination and give me that tablet right now
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.60,1:13:45.57,en,,0,0,0,,or I shall kill all of your friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.64,1:13:48.43,en,,0,0,0,,starting with the little shaggy-headed little cowman here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.51,1:13:51.91,en,,0,0,0,,I ain't shaggy-headed! Gigantor, let me take this guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.98,1:13:54.60,en,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I got this handled. You don't want to give me my friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.68,1:13:56.58,en,,0,0,0,,then you're not gonna get your combination or your tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.65,1:13:58.08,en,,0,0,0,,- All right, I'll tell you what. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.15,1:14:01.02,en,,0,0,0,,They didn't call me Kahmunrah the Trustworthy for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.12,1:14:03.78,en,,0,0,0,,Here you go. They didn't call me Kahmunrah the Trustworthy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.85,1:14:05.79,en,,0,0,0,,They called me Kahmunrah the Bloodthirsty,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.86,1:14:09.49,en,,0,0,0,,who kills whoever doesn't give Kahmunrah exactly what he wants
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.59,1:14:11.89,en,,0,0,0,,in the moment that he wants it, which is right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.96,1:14:15.16,en,,0,0,0,,when I had also better get the combination and the tablet!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.23,1:14:18.76,en,,0,0,0,,- That's what they called you? - It was shorter in Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.84,1:14:20.56,en,,0,0,0,,Great, I'll give you the combination after you give him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.64,1:14:23.70,en,,0,0,0,,How dare you? If you touch that again, I shall kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.77,1:14:25.40,en,,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Do not touch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.48,1:14:28.34,en,,0,0,0,,- This is a no-touching zone! - Good. Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.41,1:14:32.44,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! I can't believe you reached across like that again!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.52,1:14:35.95,en,,0,0,0,,I can't even believe it! Oh, God, I want to kill you right...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.02,1:14:39.75,en,,0,0,0,,If you didn't know this combination, you'd be so dead right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.82,1:14:42.82,en,,0,0,0,,- it would be unbelievable. - Great, but I do know the combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.03,1:14:46.99,en,,0,0,0,,Don't cross this line with your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.10,1:14:53.00,en,,0,0,0,,How dare you! If you speak again, I'm going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.10,1:14:54.59,en,,0,0,0,,Do you understand this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.67,1:14:56.54,en,,0,0,0,,Don't say it! Oh, God, I see you getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.64,1:14:58.77,en,,0,0,0,,- I wasn't gonna say anything. - Oh, my God, don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.84,1:15:00.97,en,,0,0,0,,I shall murder you if you talk again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.04,1:15:06.18,en,,0,0,0,,Now give me that tablet and tell me the combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.45,1:15:09.11,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. After you give me Jed and release my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.99,1:15:11.39,en,,0,0,0,,- You did all three! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.49,1:15:13.39,en,,0,0,0,,You spoke and you reached your hand across!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.49,1:15:15.36,en,,0,0,0,,Look. I can talk to you about this all night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.46,1:15:16.82,en,,0,0,0,,- How about this? - Look, just give...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.89,1:15:19.19,en,,0,0,0,,How about I don't kill you right now, like I really, really want to,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.30,1:15:21.32,en,,0,0,0,,and I give you precisely five seconds
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.40,1:15:24.13,en,,0,0,0,,to give me that tablet and tell me the combination?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.20,1:15:27.80,en,,0,0,0,,We already got the combination. It's pi.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.21,1:15:32.90,en,,0,0,0,,- 3.14159265. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.01,1:15:34.64,en,,0,0,0,,- Hey. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.38,1:15:41.41,en,,0,0,0,,So Crazy Hair here, he sang. Oh, did he sing! Like a canary.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.15,1:15:43.59,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.69,1:15:46.18,en,,0,0,0,,Enough out of you! Remember what happened last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.56,1:15:48.08,en,,0,0,0,,- That's enough. - Stupid man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.19,1:15:53.59,en,,0,0,0,,- You okay? - Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.70,1:15:56.17,en,,0,0,0,,Must be a real bummer for you, Larry,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.10,1:16:01.16,en,,0,0,0,,knowing that all of your valiant efforts were, in the end, for naught.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.54,1:16:06.24,en,,0,0,0,,What a terrible disappointment you must be to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.92,1:16:17.94,en,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that humming sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.56,1:16:21.58,en,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that sound is?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.69,1:16:25.13,en,,0,0,0,,It's rhetorical.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.80,1:16:29.42,en,,0,0,0,,That is the sound of the End.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.27,1:16:38.80,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.91,1:16:41.57,en,,0,0,0,,You did your best, Gigantor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.21,1:16:44.48,en,,0,0,0,,Dadgum it, we almost had him, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.58,1:16:47.78,en,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, I'm sorry I wasn't around the last couple of years at the museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.39,1:16:52.32,en,,0,0,0,,- Maybe none of this would have happened. - You don't get it, do you, Gigantor?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.42,1:16:54.82,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't call you 'cause we needed your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.93,1:16:56.59,en,,0,0,0,,Sure, we were in a little pickle,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.66,1:16:58.15,en,,0,0,0,,but it wouldn't have been the first time
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.26,1:17:00.89,en,,0,0,0,,I had to wrestle my way out of a root sack.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.30,1:17:04.73,en,,0,0,0,,No, partner. I called you 'cause you needed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.57,1:17:08.94,en,,0,0,0,,That fancy suit you've been parading around in these past couple years,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.01,1:17:11.10,en,,0,0,0,,that there's a hanging suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.17,1:17:14.08,en,,0,0,0,,All gussied up, but dead inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.68,1:17:16.01,en,,0,0,0,,That ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.91,1:17:19.47,en,,0,0,0,,- And I'll tell you another thing. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.58,1:17:21.24,en,,0,0,0,,This night ain't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.95,1:17:25.12,en,,0,0,0,,This little Midnight Cowboy's got some fight left in him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.19,1:17:28.35,en,,0,0,0,,Something tells me you do, too. Ho, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.35,1:18:02.12,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the new, extended reign of Kahmunrah,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.19,1:18:03.99,en,,0,0,0,,Fifth King of Egypt
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.06,1:18:06.82,en,,0,0,0,,and now the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.40,1:18:10.80,en,,0,0,0,,Horus, Ra, my warriors, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.30,1:18:16.24,en,,0,0,0,,Send Larry Daley and his friends to their doom!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.06,1:18:42.69,en,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.70,1:18:46.57,en,,0,0,0,,The mighty Octavius has returned!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.67,1:18:52.07,en,,0,0,0,,I ride on the back of nature's most fearsome creature! I ride
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.08,1:18:56.38,en,,0,0,0,,the squirrel!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.02,1:19:02.04,en,,0,0,0,,Forward now, my mighty steed!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.36,1:19:08.26,en,,0,0,0,,Whoa, girl! Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:10.52,en,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to surrender honorably?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.59,1:19:13.86,en,,0,0,0,,Or must this end with the spilling of your blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.03,1:19:18.66,en,,0,0,0,,This? This is your big rescue?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.57,1:19:22.54,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. This is!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.95,1:19:36.58,en,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.65,1:19:38.78,en,,0,0,0,,The name is Abraham Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.89,1:19:42.32,en,,0,0,0,,- And you, sir, are in a heap of trouble! - Attack it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.77,1:19:51.53,en,,0,0,0,,Disgusting half-pigeons!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.18,1:20:04.65,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:07.08,en,,0,0,0,,Adios, bird brains!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.15,1:20:08.85,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.95,1:20:10.94,en,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, strange birdmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.09,1:20:13.02,en,,0,0,0,,Do not return to the Underworld!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.12,1:20:15.11,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, do go back into the Underworld!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.19,1:20:16.75,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming! Good night!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.83,1:20:17.88,en,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.50,1:20:29.60,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.94,1:20:32.70,en,,0,0,0,,It appears my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.28,1:20:38.77,en,,0,0,0,,Just remember, son, a house divided against itself cannot stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.55,1:20:42.58,en,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.29,1:20:47.31,en,,0,0,0,,- What now? - You know, I'm not quite sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.53,1:20:52.12,en,,0,0,0,,I suppose we should probably start by watching him die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.33,1:20:56.63,en,,0,0,0,,Streltsy! Make him dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.67,1:21:01.47,en,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.87,1:21:07.00,en,,0,0,0,,We are not going to attack right
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.08,1:21:10.20,en,,0,0,0,,now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.02,1:21:20.82,en,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.54,1:21:43.21,en,,0,0,0,,Fear not, Larry! I will help Jedediah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.28,1:21:44.94,en,,0,0,0,,You come at them from behind!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.35,1:21:49.25,en,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what's going on? - I'm hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:51.58,en,,0,0,0,,Hiding? What are you doing? Come on, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.09,1:21:55.72,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm a failure. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.83,1:21:58.56,en,,0,0,0,,Did you foolishly lead 208 Americans to their deaths
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.66,1:22:00.36,en,,0,0,0,,at the Battle of Little Bighorn?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.56,1:22:06.00,en,,0,0,0,,- No. - No? Not good. Not good at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.07,1:22:08.50,en,,0,0,0,,- That's not good. - Sure, I talk a good game,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.57,1:22:11.34,en,,0,0,0,,but the truth of the matter is, I don't deserve these stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.84,1:22:16.18,en,,0,0,0,,I will always be famous for my biggest failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.28,1:22:20.37,en,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.75,1:22:22.74,en,,0,0,0,,The past is the past, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.45,1:22:26.18,en,,0,0,0,,Right now, this moment, this night,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.66,1:22:29.56,en,,0,0,0,,this is what you're gonna be remembered for.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.29,1:22:32.96,en,,0,0,0,,This is your last stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.65,1:22:53.14,en,,0,0,0,,- They need a leader. - Yeah, they need a leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.08,1:22:57.31,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah? You want to be their leader, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:23:00.15,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I do. - Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.79,1:23:01.92,en,,0,0,0,,- All right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.99,1:23:03.36,en,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.66,1:23:07.06,en,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.56,1:23:08.55,en,,0,0,0,,Larry!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.30,1:23:10.39,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Able!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.47,1:23:11.46,en,,0,0,0,,I want to help!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.60,1:23:12.69,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.77,1:23:14.46,en,,0,0,0,,Who are you? This is my museum!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.84,1:23:16.60,en,,0,0,0,,Well, he's my human. Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.81,1:23:18.36,en,,0,0,0,,You need all the help you can get, Jungle-Dweller!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.98,1:23:19.96,en,,0,0,0,,Get over yourself space snob!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.04,1:23:21.07,en,,0,0,0,,Guys! Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.14,1:23:23.01,en,,0,0,0,,This is not the time to get into this, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.28,1:23:26.61,en,,0,0,0,,Dexter, you know better.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.58,1:23:30.45,en,,0,0,0,,All right? That's what happens when you do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.52,1:23:31.85,en,,0,0,0,,You get that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.10,1:23:41.43,en,,0,0,0,,Stop! Just stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.00,1:23:44.99,en,,0,0,0,,Now, listen. You're both proud capuchin!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.87,1:23:47.67,en,,0,0,0,,You need to concentrate on slapping the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.54,1:23:52.84,en,,0,0,0,,Keep it together, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.94,1:23:54.84,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:59.65,en,,0,0,0,,- Jedediah! They need us! - I ain't gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.05,1:24:02.52,en,,0,0,0,,Afraid this cowboy's been to his last hoedown.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.02,1:24:08.86,en,,0,0,0,,Octavius, remember me as I was, wild, and free, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.13,1:24:13.56,en,,0,0,0,,- No need for final words. - I'm not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:15.76,en,,0,0,0,,I want to get to the story of our relationship,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.83,1:24:18.13,en,,0,0,0,,the evolution from enemy to friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.30,1:24:20.63,en,,0,0,0,,- No! - It'll make you cry!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.70,1:24:23.97,en,,0,0,0,,No! Because you are going to live!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.95,1:24:37.42,en,,0,0,0,,- Let's go to work. - Have a sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.55,1:24:39.99,en,,0,0,0,,Sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.21,1:24:58.87,en,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.13,1:25:19.36,en,,0,0,0,,That smarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.97,1:25:25.70,en,,0,0,0,,You smack, you kick! You smack, you kick!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.77,1:25:29.10,en,,0,0,0,,You smack, you kick! Teamwork, fellas! Wunderbar!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.04,1:25:34.41,en,,0,0,0,,How you doing, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.58,1:26:07.30,en,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right? - Never better.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.41,1:26:09.57,en,,0,0,0,,Listen, when I give you the signal, I want you to open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.65,1:26:12.48,en,,0,0,0,,- I take it you have a plan. - I'm gonna divide the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.62,1:26:20.09,en,,0,0,0,,The tablet! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.16,1:26:21.59,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.66,1:26:23.65,en,,0,0,0,,Just tell me who the boss is and I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.76,1:26:26.25,en,,0,0,0,,Or should I give it to Kahmunrah? He's your master, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.53,1:26:30.19,en,,0,0,0,,- Nyet! He is not our master! - Really? 'Cause he acts like he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.30,1:26:32.29,en,,0,0,0,,But fine, just tell me who the boss is and you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.37,1:26:34.77,en,,0,0,0,,Hey! That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.14,1:26:39.30,en,,0,0,0,,This man is a peasant! I am the only one here of noble birth!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.38,1:26:42.34,en,,0,0,0,,Really? 'Cause he's got more medals and a bigger hat, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.45,1:26:44.47,en,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - You might got a lot of medals,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:47.18,en,,0,0,0,,but you put one of your little child hands on that tablet again,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.28,1:26:50.12,en,,0,0,0,,it'll be the last thing them tiny little mitts of yours ever touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.19,1:26:52.05,en,,0,0,0,,Why would you touch little Nippy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.12,1:26:55.49,en,,0,0,0,,I can handle this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.56,1:26:58.65,en,,0,0,0,,You can handle nothing! You can barely speak, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.73,1:27:02.66,en,,0,0,0,,You know what? No problem. I'll give it to you. You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.54,1:27:08.13,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a spunky little fella!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.34,1:27:17.75,en,,0,0,0,,Very clever, Mr. Daley, getting them to fight amongst themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.85,1:27:21.65,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can't really take credit. It was Abraham Lincoln's idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.72,1:27:24.08,en,,0,0,0,,You know, a house divided can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.92,1:27:26.91,en,,0,0,0,,- Doesn't do well. - Yes, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.02,1:27:30.72,en,,0,0,0,,you should have saved yourself when you had the chance,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.33,1:27:34.59,en,,0,0,0,,because now I shall have the tremendous pleasure
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.00,1:27:36.33,en,,0,0,0,,of killing you myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.12,1:28:28.48,en,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.65,1:28:32.09,en,,0,0,0,,I'm the night guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.76,1:28:35.55,en,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.73,1:28:46.67,en,,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.44,1:28:49.60,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.58,1:28:57.27,en,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.35,1:28:59.21,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.09,1:29:06.52,en,,0,0,0,,I'd say somebody found his moxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.62,1:29:10.46,en,,0,0,0,,The Battle of the Smithsonian.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.09,1:29:15.50,en,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the greatest battle the world will never know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.87,1:29:19.20,en,,0,0,0,,We'll know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.61,1:29:24.20,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.01,1:29:28.81,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I got an hour till sunrise. I got to get you guys back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.88,1:29:32.87,en,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, Gigantor, they don't want us there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.98,1:29:34.35,en,,0,0,0,,Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.02,1:29:40.72,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, think you could hook us up with a ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.02,1:29:43.86,en,,0,0,0,,My pleasure, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.66,1:29:48.15,en,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second. One last thing I got to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.17,1:29:52.07,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, boy! Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:54.00,en,,0,0,0,,Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.87,1:29:58.31,en,,0,0,0,,Feels good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.41,1:30:05.31,en,,0,0,0,,You're welcome! Just get back inside by sunrise, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.06,1:30:21.96,en,,0,0,0,,These are promising days, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.12,1:30:46.78,en,,0,0,0,,All right. Hey, come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.89,1:30:49.95,en,,0,0,0,,Remember, stay with your buddy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.06,1:30:51.42,en,,0,0,0,,Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.41,1:31:04.13,en,,0,0,0,,Well, you're back where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.28,1:31:08.07,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.88,1:31:16.37,en,,0,0,0,,I guess I should be going.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.79,1:31:20.31,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.83,1:31:25.56,en,,0,0,0,,That thing that I was trying to tell you about earlier...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.40,1:31:30.89,en,,0,0,0,,There's not really an easy way to put this,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.97,1:31:35.99,en,,0,0,0,,- but, in the morning... - I know what's coming, Mr. Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.11,1:31:37.47,en,,0,0,0,,I've always known.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.24,1:31:40.94,en,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.01,1:31:44.97,en,,0,0,0,,You've given me the adventure of a lifetime in one night.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.12,1:31:50.52,en,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling it's going to be a beautiful sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.86,1:32:00.35,en,,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.64,1:32:10.97,en,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.19,1:33:05.99,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you fellas, but this old cowboy just got to second base.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.90,1:33:11.30,en,,0,0,0,,- There she goes. - Straight towards...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.87,1:33:14.56,en,,0,0,0,,Canada.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.57,1:33:17.40,en,,0,0,0,,She's heading to Canada.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.74,1:33:21.71,en,,0,0,0,,No, now she course-corrected.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.32,1:33:27.65,en,,0,0,0,,Here, head on downstairs, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.72,1:33:29.18,en,,0,0,0,,- All righty. - Good night, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.25,1:33:30.72,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, boy, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.32,1:33:35.09,en,,0,0,0,,Lawrence! Bless you for bringing them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.19,1:33:37.89,en,,0,0,0,,And might I say, a hearty well-done is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.99,1:33:41.43,en,,0,0,0,,And may I also point out, they cannot hide in the basement forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.50,1:33:43.12,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No, I think I got that figured out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.20,1:33:44.32,en,,0,0,0,,- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.40,1:33:46.20,en,,0,0,0,,Sun come, dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.20,1:33:49.40,en,,0,0,0,,Our moai friend is right. The dawn will soon be upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.51,1:33:50.94,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.01,1:33:52.50,en,,0,0,0,,Remember the other night you were saying something
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.58,1:33:53.87,en,,0,0,0,,about the key to happiness?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.94,1:33:55.67,en,,0,0,0,,- Did I? - You said, The key to happiness is...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.74,1:33:58.21,en,,0,0,0,,And then the sun came up and you froze.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.28,1:34:00.04,en,,0,0,0,,- I think I got it figured out. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.55,1:34:03.85,en,,0,0,0,,It's doing what you love, isn't it? With people you love.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.12,1:34:07.95,en,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was going to say "physical exercise",
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.06,1:34:09.46,en,,0,0,0,,but the love thing's good, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.20,1:34:17.39,en,,0,0,0,,- Lawrence! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.74,1:34:21.40,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.77,1:34:25.21,en,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.12,1:34:43.75,en,,0,0,0,,Well, folks, the wait is over. After two months of renovation,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.83,1:34:47.56,en,,0,0,0,,tonight, The Museum of Natural History reopens its doors to the public.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.63,1:34:50.00,en,,0,0,0,,As you can see, New Yorkers are flooding in,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:52.62,en,,0,0,0,,eager to see just what changes are in store.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.74,1:34:54.46,en,,0,0,0,,With its new, extended night hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.57,1:34:57.27,en,,0,0,0,,we're told the museum will be more lively than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.28,1:35:10.51,en,,0,0,0,,- Well, well, well, well! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.35,1:35:13.98,en,,0,0,0,,I see the uniform still fits after these long, long years.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.09,1:35:16.46,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Really hasn't been that long, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.36,1:35:21.32,en,,0,0,0,,So, to what do we owe this "triumphant" return?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.43,1:35:24.87,en,,0,0,0,,Not cut out for the "corporate" jungle after all. Got fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.67,1:35:29.64,en,,0,0,0,,No, actually, I sold my company.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.71,1:35:32.67,en,,0,0,0,,The world doth move in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.78,1:35:35.61,en,,0,0,0,,One day, we've got to get rid of everything old,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.68,1:35:41.71,en,,0,0,0,,the next, a rich, anonymous donor gives a huge endowment.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.82,1:35:45.78,en,,0,0,0,,With a proviso: Everything stays the same. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.46,1:35:52.83,en,,0,0,0,,- Well, not exactly the same, obviously. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.90,1:35:55.83,en,,0,0,0,,Bully, lads and ladies, the name is Theodore Roosevelt,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.90,1:36:00.73,en,,0,0,0,,naturalist, Rough Rider and twenty-sixth President of these great United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.84,1:36:04.33,en,,0,0,0,,Come along, lad. The hunt is afoot. Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.88,1:36:12.75,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, you dum-dums bring me gum-gum?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.59,1:36:23.92,en,,0,0,0,,My parents gave me this tablet some 3,000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.03,1:36:28.19,en,,0,0,0,,entrusting me with one of my people's most prized possessions.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.26,1:36:31.10,en,,0,0,0,,- Does it do anything? - Do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.20,1:36:33.23,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What's the point if it doesn't do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.37,1:36:35.46,en,,0,0,0,,Tell 'em
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.54,1:36:40.07,en,,0,0,0,,Actually, it has a magical power that brings all the exhibits to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.18,1:36:41.61,en,,0,0,0,,No, really, what's it do?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.28,1:36:45.77,en,,0,0,0,,Nothing. It's just for decoration.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.88,1:36:47.21,en,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.38,1:36:52.25,en,,0,0,0,,This place is lame. This thing doesn't even look real.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.35,1:36:55.45,en,,0,0,0,,Seriously, dude, these animatronics suck.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.93,1:37:06.37,en,,0,0,0,,- Mammoth? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.44,1:37:07.87,en,,0,0,0,,Extinct!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.24,1:37:10.60,en,,0,0,0,,- Today's technology is beyond me. - I know. It's so lifelike.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.71,1:37:12.64,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, yeah, yeah. - Something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.04,1:37:14.87,en,,0,0,0,,You'll stick around a bit longer this time,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.94,1:37:17.61,en,,0,0,0,,or you gonna run away again when you get something better?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.71,1:37:20.15,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna stay. - Stay, for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.25,1:37:21.44,en,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.08,1:37:27.61,en,,0,0,0,,Good. 'Cause, as night guards go, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.46,1:37:30.72,en,,0,0,0,,- What? - The best.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.96,1:37:33.55,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.90,1:37:41.13,en,,0,0,0,,You, the toddler! Don't hug the displays.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.84,1:38:18.90,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.97,1:38:20.97,en,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to stare. I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.31,1:38:24.51,en,,0,0,0,,You look a lot like somebody I know, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.28,1:38:26.68,en,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.78,1:38:30.31,en,,0,0,0,,- Do you? - Yeah. I guess I have that kind of face.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.02,1:38:32.71,en,,0,0,0,,- Familiar. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.79,1:38:36.78,en,,0,0,0,,You're not by any chance related to Amelia Earhart, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.56,1:38:38.96,en,,0,0,0,,- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.03,1:38:41.02,en,,0,0,0,,- No, I don't think so. - Of course you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.13,1:38:45.07,en,,0,0,0,,- I mean, I don't know. Maybe I'm... - I just had to ask. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.67,1:38:49.16,en,,0,0,0,,She was that woman who flew across the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.24,1:38:51.07,en,,0,0,0,,- The Atlantic. - Atlantic. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.17,1:38:53.66,en,,0,0,0,,First woman to fly across the Atlantic, and she received the Flying Cross,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.74,1:38:55.33,en,,0,0,0,,first woman to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.08,1:38:59.24,en,,0,0,0,,- That's very cool. - Yeah, she was cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.69,1:39:10.25,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what you should check out is the the Hall of Miniatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.93,1:39:14.49,en,,0,0,0,,Could you take me there? I'm always getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.93,1:39:20.89,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Sure. Yeah, I'll show you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.54,1:39:23.06,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.57,1:39:25.73,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm Larry Daley. - Tess.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.81,1:40:03.87,en,,0,0,0,,- Joseph, time for dinner! - One second, Ma!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.95,1:40:08.14,en,,0,0,0,,Joey Motorola, you get down here for supper right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.25,1:40:11.74,en,,0,0,0,,I said one second, Ma! I really think I'm on to something here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.00,cn,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:26.64,cn,,0,0,0,,《博物馆奇妙夜2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.82,cn,,0,0,0,,(永久保存 联邦档案室)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:36.69,cn,,0,0,0,,假设这是你的家 突然断电 一片漆黑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.96,cn,,0,0,0,,小家伙们被困在双层床上 在走廊另一端房间哭喊着...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.37,cn,,0,0,0,,妈妈!爸爸!快来!我害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:43.60,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你必须第一时间赶过去 - 来了宝贝!爸爸来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:46.14,cn,,0,0,0,,你需要一件防身的家伙 但首先 你需要的是一个手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.17,cn,,0,0,0,,但你四周一片漆黑 你该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.21,cn,,0,0,0,,要怎么找到手电筒? 让我来告诉你答案
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.01,cn,,0,0,0,,夜光手电筒!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.71,cn,,0,0,0,,没错 朋友们! 我是戴利设备的拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:58.01,cn,,0,0,0,,接下去的电视导购单元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.38,cn,,0,0,0,,将令您终身难忘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:03.39,cn,,0,0,0,,和我一起来的还有我的朋友 女士们先生们 欢迎乔治·福尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:08.28,cn,,0,0,0,,棒极了 拉瑞 棒极了! 大家说他是不是很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.70,cn,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 这一切都是真的吗 仅仅两年以前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.40,cn,,0,0,0,,你还只是一名博物馆夜班守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:22.24,cn,,0,0,0,,没错 你是连续两届世界重量级拳王 乔治·福尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.54,cn,,0,0,0,,而我只是一个小人物乔 拿着夜光手电筒怀揣着一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:28.64,cn,,0,0,0,,应该是小人物拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:41.32,cn,,0,0,0,,但如今你是戴利设备的首席执行官 这可是当真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:46.16,cn,,0,0,0,,你的发明已经成了我们生活的必备品 比如超级大狗骨头!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:50.29,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你们喜欢吗? - 还有防丢失钥匙圈!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.00,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 对 那个小栗子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:56.13,cn,,0,0,0,,而现在你又推出了最新发明 大家一起说!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:58.97,cn,,0,0,0,,夜光手电筒!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.45,cn,,0,0,0,,家庭安防有保障 这里是戴利设备 有什么可以帮助您?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.99,cn,,0,0,0,,蒂娜 把这份文件还给斯图尔特 他的计算能力糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.65,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那家伙又打来了 - 又打来?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:12.72,cn,,0,0,0,,拉瑞!爆炸新闻! 沃尔玛终于同意和我们进行合作洽谈了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.42,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不会吧!什么时候? - 三天后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.59,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 好的 那我们有的好准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:21.00,cn,,0,0,0,,你有听我说吗?那可是沃尔玛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.57,cn,,0,0,0,,是!我知道 这是件大事!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:24.67,cn,,0,0,0,,那该庆贺一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.10,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.91,cn,,0,0,0,,你真是太扫兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.17,cn,,0,0,0,,今天全公司集体庆祝直到关门 怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.95,cn,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.78,cn,,0,0,0,,- 他想约什么时候见面? - 礼拜五早上十点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.61,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道该怎么做 取消推广会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.88,cn,,0,0,0,,关于螺旋推进电锯的那个 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:40.28,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我得集中思想 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.08,cn,,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 我女儿的生日也泡汤了!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.53,cn,,0,0,0,,你可以先回去 我会呆到很晚 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.20,cn,,0,0,0,,是 老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.79,cn,,0,0,0,,(自然历史博物馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:08.83,cn,,0,0,0,,(关闭整修)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.78,cn,,0,0,0,,嗨抱歉 未经许可不得入内!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:20.59,cn,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的一夜成名先生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.63,cn,,0,0,0,,来重游故地吗? 好几个月没看到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:27.69,cn,,0,0,0,,对 我一直很忙 这里怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:30.87,cn,,0,0,0,,发展 他们这样告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:37.31,cn,,0,0,0,,这是发展趋势 自然历史博物馆 2.0版
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:47.02,cn,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到自然历史博物馆 这里能看到最鲜活的历史
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.92,cn,,0,0,0,,站出来 问出你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:51.42,cn,,0,0,0,,孩子们排好队一个一个来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:56.46,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 你的出生地?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.89,cn,,0,0,0,,就在这里 纽约市 二十大街
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:02.47,cn,,0,0,0,,我生于1858年10月27日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:08.60,cn,,0,0,0,,历史 历史 学习 学习
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.90,cn,,0,0,0,,改变美国人民 一次一个孩子提问
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.25,cn,,0,0,0,,很棒 这么说你们打算增加一些这样的互动展品?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:19.21,cn,,0,0,0,,不 戴利先生 不是增加 而是替换所有旧的展品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.88,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那旧展品放去哪里? - 清理出去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.75,cn,,0,0,0,,这些垃圾都要被清走 模型 蜡像
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:28.56,cn,,0,0,0,,还有这些破烂的动物模型 比如这只手骨嶙峋的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.43,cn,,0,0,0,,你手脚轻点 它是只僧帽猴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.39,cn,,0,0,0,,它是个猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.40,cn,,0,0,0,,它是稀有品种 它叫僧帽猴 不是只普通猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.71,cn,,0,0,0,,猴子 它就叫猴子 干嘛分的这么细?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.94,cn,,0,0,0,,当你准备扔掉一只猴子时 你不需要为它取个拉丁名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.58,cn,,0,0,0,,你到底是扔掉它还是搬到别的地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:47.87,cn,,0,0,0,,你专管灵长垃圾吗? 算了吧 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.27,cn,,0,0,0,,- 这是谁的主意? - 当然是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.22,cn,,0,0,0,,这事我说了算 我和董事会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.68,cn,,0,0,0,,主要是董事会的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.98,cn,,0,0,0,,你管这么多干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.99,cn,,0,0,0,,不是 人们爱这些展品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:02.12,cn,,0,0,0,,人们 戴利先生 永远喜新厌旧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.59,cn,,0,0,0,,这你应该清楚 你不是也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.69,cn,,0,0,0,,我的情况不一样 我的生意刚刚起步
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.43,cn,,0,0,0,,对 你成功了 如果我是夜班守卫 我也能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.74,cn,,0,0,0,,那这些会被运到哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.31,cn,,0,0,0,,联邦档案馆的地下储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.41,cn,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿? - 华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.51,cn,,0,0,0,,史密森尼学会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.25,cn,,0,0,0,,我们可以阻止他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:28.19,cn,,0,0,0,,没用了!它们明天早上就会被运走 都结束了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:08.92,cn,,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计 你好吗? 你这把老骨头还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.63,cn,,0,0,0,,想看看我给你带什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:15.60,cn,,0,0,0,,猜猜我给你带什么? 是一条绳子吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.47,cn,,0,0,0,,你扯得过我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:20.13,cn,,0,0,0,,你就这点力气吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:40.79,cn,,0,0,0,,劳伦斯!很高兴见到你 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:42.33,cn,,0,0,0,,我也是 泰德!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:44.46,cn,,0,0,0,,布鲁克林的守护者回来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.77,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 阿克 听着 麦克菲都告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.23,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我有个主意 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.10,cn,,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 你最后一次来这儿以后 发生了很多事 俗话说...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.54,cn,,0,0,0,,- 稍等 - 忙人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:10:01.35,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 谁来帮把手!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:05.28,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:09.05,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 你们好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.66,cn,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:14.22,cn,,0,0,0,,大人物亲自来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.70,cn,,0,0,0,,你正好赶上见我们最后一面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.20,cn,,0,0,0,,杰德 我听说了 听着 我真的不知道事情会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:23.89,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 你当然会觉得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:27.44,cn,,0,0,0,,也许答案就在你手里那个 嗡嗡作响的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:30.78,cn,,0,0,0,,你不在这里了 铁人 所以事情才会变成这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.18,cn,,0,0,0,,没什么可奇怪的!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:35.21,cn,,0,0,0,,事实是 拉瑞 他们开会的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.51,cn,,0,0,0,,没人再为我们说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.88,cn,,0,0,0,,没人 没人 笨瓜 笨瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.52,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们!没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:45.99,cn,,0,0,0,,我明天一早就给董事会打电话好吗? 我会做弥补
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.99,cn,,0,0,0,,我会处理好 我们都会没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.43,cn,,0,0,0,,我们?你听见了吗? 还是我们在做白日梦 强尼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:54.39,cn,,0,0,0,,自从你对我们撒手不管以后 你是你 我们是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.77,cn,,0,0,0,,这真让人心寒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:59.07,cn,,0,0,0,,拉瑞 悲剧已经发生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:03.88,cn,,0,0,0,,即使辉煌的罗马帝国也有灭亡的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.21,cn,,0,0,0,,你能不能别用这种悲哀的眼神看着空气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.87,cn,,0,0,0,,你这么说 让我更加痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:12.05,cn,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.24,cn,,0,0,0,,你看什么?你看什么? 我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.79,cn,,0,0,0,,我只是在看着墙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.55,cn,,0,0,0,,听着伙计们 也许事情没那么糟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.66,cn,,0,0,0,,对 你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:27.00,cn,,0,0,0,,我们只是要去史密森尼而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.56,cn,,0,0,0,,德克斯特 你根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:34.31,cn,,0,0,0,,重点不是这个 铁人 我们要被扫地出门了!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.74,cn,,0,0,0,,拉瑞 我知道你只是在安慰我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.71,cn,,0,0,0,,我能看得出你在真诚的为我们着急
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.88,cn,,0,0,0,,但今天也许是最后一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.48,cn,,0,0,0,,我们所有人 聚在一起 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:47.05,cn,,0,0,0,,这里再也不是家了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:53.59,cn,,0,0,0,,杰迪戴亚 别这样 劳伦斯 这种情况下大家都容易激动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.49,cn,,0,0,0,,但这是我们作为一家人的最后一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:59.40,cn,,0,0,0,,我不愿意看着你们浪费时间自怨自艾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:05.20,cn,,0,0,0,,让我们在这神圣大殿做最后一次游行吧 谁愿意来?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.84,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你想去逛一圈吗? - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:13.40,cn,,0,0,0,,我只想自怨自艾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.58,cn,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 上马吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.94,cn,,0,0,0,,一路平安 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.85,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 德克斯特 要帮忙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.86,cn,,0,0,0,,别这样伙计 别闹情绪好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.79,cn,,0,0,0,,都会过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.13,cn,,0,0,0,,天快亮了 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:09.86,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 那么 你的木箱呢 泰德?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.80,cn,,0,0,0,,我不和他们一起走 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:15.54,cn,,0,0,0,,我 雷克斯 还有其他一些签名展品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.20,cn,,0,0,0,,还要留下 暂时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:20.51,cn,,0,0,0,,可是复活金牌不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:24.21,cn,,0,0,0,,事实上 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:31.32,cn,,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉的复活金牌 会和他一起留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.99,0:13:34.09,cn,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.89,cn,,0,0,0,,复活金牌不能随他们一起走了 我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.40,cn,,0,0,0,,这恐怕是他们的最后一夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:43.26,cn,,0,0,0,,你没告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:47.50,cn,,0,0,0,,作为一个绅士 痛苦我们只会留给自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:05.91,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你会没事吧? - 我会尽力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.85,cn,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.80,cn,,0,0,0,,俗话说 塞翁失马焉知非福
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.39,cn,,0,0,0,,看看你 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:19.20,cn,,0,0,0,,你离开之后 生活发生了翻天覆地的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.63,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 也许你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:26.24,cn,,0,0,0,,我的朋友 你要对自己有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:29.81,cn,,0,0,0,,你是大企业的老板 一手掌握大权
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.88,0:14:31.48,cn,,0,0,0,,在我看来 你拥有了一切你想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.71,cn,,0,0,0,,没有 我自己知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.31,cn,,0,0,0,,不 你不懂 如果可以 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.42,cn,,0,0,0,,请允许我给你一点建议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:44.96,cn,,0,0,0,,获得真正幸福的关键是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:48.96,cn,,0,0,0,,稍等一下 我得...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.23,cn,,0,0,0,,处理一下这宗和日本人的买卖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:56.64,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 算了 我关机吧 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.80,cn,,0,0,0,,幸福的关键是?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.65,cn,,0,0,0,,再见 泰德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.12,cn,,0,0,0,,(自然历史博物馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.35,cn,,0,0,0,,他们真的走了? 你什么忙都没帮上?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.69,cn,,0,0,0,,我也想做点什么伙计 告诉你 我已经竭尽所能了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:48.23,cn,,0,0,0,,我和麦克菲谈了 给董事会打了电话 但今早他们还是被运走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.85,cn,,0,0,0,,好多吃的啊 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.56,cn,,0,0,0,,对 我公司的爱德今天要过来 我记得我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.83,cn,,0,0,0,,我们要讨论一些工作上的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:58.24,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那今晚你要工作? - 以前我每晚都工作 记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.97,cn,,0,0,0,,那时你拥有全世界最酷的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.58,cn,,0,0,0,,但是"酷"可支付不起你昂贵的吉他 和别的花销
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.98,cn,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 铁人! 是我 杰迪戴亚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.54,cn,,0,0,0,,- 撑住!撑住! - 杰德?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.02,cn,,0,0,0,,决不投降!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.42,cn,,0,0,0,,杰德 你们在干嘛? 你是怎么拨通电话的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.99,cn,,0,0,0,,说来话长 那个死猴子偷来了复活金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:19.18,cn,,0,0,0,,我们这里都打成一片了老兄!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.42,cn,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了? - 卡门拉!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:24.39,cn,,0,0,0,,- 卡门拉? - 阿卡曼拉的哥哥 他来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.56,cn,,0,0,0,,相信我 他是来者不善!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.36,cn,,0,0,0,,我重复一遍 来者不善!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.40,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那是匈奴王的声音吗? 杰德 - 我不知道我们还能撑多久
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:31.90,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不要! - 杰德? 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.40,cn,,0,0,0,,- 放开我!救命! - 嘿 杰德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.44,cn,,0,0,0,,- 放开我 放开 你放开我 救命啊! - 杰德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.24,cn,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.84,cn,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.22,cn,,0,0,0,,快点 我要把你送到你妈那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.95,cn,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了 老爸? - 我会去弄清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.76,cn,,0,0,0,,伙计 麦克菲说联邦档案馆在史密森尼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.30,cn,,0,0,0,,那我究竟要去哪里找?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:02.60,cn,,0,0,0,,问得好 老爸 史密森尼其实是19座不同的博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.40,cn,,0,0,0,,它们围绕着国家广场
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:07.10,cn,,0,0,0,,从国会大厦一直到林肯纪念碑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.30,cn,,0,0,0,,那里面什么藏品都有 确实有很多特别酷的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:13.61,cn,,0,0,0,,尼克 别扯别的 档案馆到底在哪座博物馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:17.28,cn,,0,0,0,,不是博物馆里 而是地下 它占据了整个史密森尼的地下空间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:19.59,cn,,0,0,0,,那么如果阿卡曼拉的复活金牌在那下面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:22.14,cn,,0,0,0,,所有历史人物都将重见天日
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:23.89,cn,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办 老爸?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.29,cn,,0,0,0,,- 这你别担心 - 你根本没有计划是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:29.60,cn,,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯 我有一个超级绝妙的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.06,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你没有计划 - 好吧 我没有计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.50,cn,,0,0,0,,我进去后再联络
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.14,cn,,0,0,0,,给你 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:51.59,cn,,0,0,0,,(航天航空馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:55.00,cn,,0,0,0,,(美国空军)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.46,cn,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到全世界最大的博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.50,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 这像一场旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:08.69,cn,,0,0,0,,那些挂在天花板上的飞机怎么样? 很神奇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.50,cn,,0,0,0,,不好意思打扰了 请问联邦档案馆怎么去?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:15.77,cn,,0,0,0,,如果你是一个有永久保存价值的档案 就能进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.17,cn,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑 他不是档案
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:23.55,cn,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 档案馆在地下层 那里是禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:27.31,cn,,0,0,0,,真的? 完全禁止入内吗? 好吧 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:39.11,cn,,0,0,0,,(非员工请勿进入)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.41,cn,,0,0,0,,(爱因斯坦摇头公仔)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:14.03,cn,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 博物馆将在一小时后闭馆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:36.56,cn,,0,0,0,,(禁止进入 请出示证件)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.14,cn,,0,0,0,,(卡彭逃漏税被捕)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.75,cn,,0,0,0,,(卡门拉之门 通往底下世界之门)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.44,cn,,0,0,0,,卡门拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:09.35,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 你想干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.89,cn,,0,0,0,,- 严禁触摸 - 不 我没有想摸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.95,cn,,0,0,0,,你已经产生"摸机"了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:17.19,cn,,0,0,0,,- 摸机? - 触摸动机 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:19.36,cn,,0,0,0,,我没有 我知道这不许碰...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.80,cn,,0,0,0,,- 怎么 你还想亲它吗? - 好吧 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.10,cn,,0,0,0,,你手放上去碰一下试试 我站在那儿等上一天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.87,cn,,0,0,0,,就是等像你这样想摸它的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:30.07,cn,,0,0,0,,用她带着光鲜亮丽指甲的手碰展品
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:32.94,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为我们生活在一个自由民主的国家...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.10,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不 不是 - 不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.58,cn,,0,0,0,,这个国家规定你 不许碰你前面的这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.28,cn,,0,0,0,,我只是想... 在这儿站着看不犯法吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.78,cn,,0,0,0,,你碰一下试试!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:42.15,cn,,0,0,0,,你在威胁我吗? 你在威胁我吗 布兰顿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.16,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是布伦顿 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.72,cn,,0,0,0,,- 布伦顿 - 布伦顿?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.49,cn,,0,0,0,,- 布伦顿 - 布伦顿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:50.26,cn,,0,0,0,,好像印你的胸卡时他们丢了个字母
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.66,cn,,0,0,0,,不知道 你妈是不是没教过你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.60,cn,,0,0,0,,什么时候该开玩笑?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.90,cn,,0,0,0,,不好意思 看上去像是布兰顿...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:57.96,cn,,0,0,0,,我不是来教你语音的 是布伦顿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.66,cn,,0,0,0,,- 布伦顿 好的... - 你以前没听说过这名字吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:01.07,cn,,0,0,0,,布伦顿?没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.44,cn,,0,0,0,,1984年最流行的名字 布伦顿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.14,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 你在威胁我吗 布伦顿?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.58,cn,,0,0,0,,我不知道 茉莉公主 我有吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:12.11,cn,,0,0,0,,- 哇 月光九号手电筒 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.48,cn,,0,0,0,,硬件不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.28,cn,,0,0,0,,- 商标在这儿 月光九号 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:17.82,cn,,0,0,0,,我个人更偏爱美光手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.82,cn,,0,0,0,,- 帮我个大忙 - 什么忙?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:23.92,cn,,0,0,0,,把手放回裤带 放低你的姿态
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.79,cn,,0,0,0,,还有 对人友好些
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:28.43,cn,,0,0,0,,我能再问你一个问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:30.26,cn,,0,0,0,,- 可以 - 我只想弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:33.53,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我不能碰它 对吗? - 好吧 你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.34,cn,,0,0,0,,你想找死吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:36.43,cn,,0,0,0,,你活得不耐烦了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:37.81,cn,,0,0,0,,我会用手电筒打你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.87,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你在威胁我 - 别碰它!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:41.54,cn,,0,0,0,,- 别碰我! - 你别碰它!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:42.95,cn,,0,0,0,,- 别碰它! - 你别碰我!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.31,cn,,0,0,0,,我想怎么碰你就怎么碰你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:45.94,cn,,0,0,0,,不 你的手电筒是用来照明的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:48.51,cn,,0,0,0,,我打个比方 我们去露营
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:51.11,cn,,0,0,0,,开着车横跨美国 一路上我都要拿手电筒碰你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:53.13,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你别这样 - 别怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:54.86,cn,,0,0,0,,我就碰了你了怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.90,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你等着瞧 - 瞧什么瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.79,cn,,0,0,0,,瞧你傻站在那儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.96,cn,,0,0,0,,说真的 布兰顿...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:04.23,cn,,0,0,0,,- 布伦顿 - 布伦顿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.07,cn,,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:08.66,cn,,0,0,0,,你知道当守卫意味着什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.87,cn,,0,0,0,,相信我 你根本不懂守卫的含义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:14.01,cn,,0,0,0,,我见过的东西你连想都不敢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:16.88,cn,,0,0,0,,- 比如什么? - 我不会告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:18.71,cn,,0,0,0,,- 但是你得放下手电筒... - 你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.68,cn,,0,0,0,,听上去你有什么很有意思的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.75,cn,,0,0,0,,对 可惜你听不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.35,cn,,0,0,0,,放下手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:34.50,cn,,0,0,0,,没事了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:37.10,cn,,0,0,0,,你刚才真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:38.53,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:40.40,cn,,0,0,0,,别记恨我好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:43.20,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吗? 对不起 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.27,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 不 是我的错 我不应该...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.40,cn,,0,0,0,,不 一个巴掌拍不响 再说...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.11,cn,,0,0,0,,你只是在尽你的本职 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:52.05,cn,,0,0,0,,- 放松点 伙计 - 好的!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:54.95,cn,,0,0,0,,那家伙真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:24.32,cn,,0,0,0,,(更衣室)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:42.79,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好了 伙计 我进去了 - 太棒了 告诉我你现在的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.70,cn,,0,0,0,,城堡的东北角走廊 刚出国会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.77,0:23:47.97,cn,,0,0,0,,- 带我到档案馆 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:49.77,cn,,0,0,0,,到走廊尽头 右转
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:51.78,cn,,0,0,0,,在你左手边可以看到一个楼梯间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:54.85,cn,,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 这下面像个迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:57.64,cn,,0,0,0,,地下通道把不同建筑连成一体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.75,0:23:59.31,cn,,0,0,0,,- 地形非常复杂 - 我们没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:01.32,cn,,0,0,0,,还有28分钟太阳就落山了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:04.52,cn,,0,0,0,,下到B层以后 再一次左转
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:07.75,cn,,0,0,0,,- 尼克 喂 尼克? - 老爸!听得见吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:09.26,cn,,0,0,0,,尼克 你说...尼克?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:39.72,cn,,0,0,0,,- 身份 布伦顿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.36,0:24:42.83,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你晚了 老兄 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:55.14,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 大伙儿都在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:54.94,cn,,0,0,0,,(卡斯特将军)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.79,0:26:05.81,cn,,0,0,0,,(阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:07.88,cn,,0,0,0,,(飞越大西洋女飞行员第一人 1937失踪于海洋)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.43,0:26:29.26,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:05.37,cn,,0,0,0,,你这个捣蛋鬼 我一会儿再找你算账
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:46.94,cn,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.53,0:28:07.26,cn,,0,0,0,,英语 英语会说吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.74,0:28:10.13,cn,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:16.10,cn,,0,0,0,,我是卡门拉 我是王中之王
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.21,0:28:19.58,cn,,0,0,0,,从最黑暗的古老历史深处
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:23.55,cn,,0,0,0,,我死而复生!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:30.51,cn,,0,0,0,,你大概没听清我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:36.09,cn,,0,0,0,,我是古老埃及的法老 我曾经死去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:40.60,cn,,0,0,0,,但是现在 我死而复生!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.33,0:28:44.30,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 是 我听清了 我明白你的意思 欢迎回来!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.81,0:28:52.80,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁? - 戴利设备的拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:57.01,cn,,0,0,0,,我公司在纽约市 很有趣 我还认识你弟弟阿卡曼拉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.41,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:02.18,cn,,0,0,0,,他说他认识我弟弟 最受宠的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:04.78,cn,,0,0,0,,- 对 是个好孩子 - 谁说不是呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:07.96,cn,,0,0,0,,知道吗 妈妈和爸爸总是把所有最好的给他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.03,0:29:11.26,cn,,0,0,0,,我说的是所有 甚至包括王位
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.80,0:29:14.13,cn,,0,0,0,,我才应该是王位继承人!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.60,cn,,0,0,0,,- 他没提过这事 - 我打赌他不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:24.04,cn,,0,0,0,,不过卡门拉时代现在来临了 因为我死而复...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:26.01,cn,,0,0,0,,算了 把金牌给我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.11,0:29:28.31,cn,,0,0,0,,别给他 铁人!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:30.87,cn,,0,0,0,,安静!你们给我安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:35.12,cn,,0,0,0,,- 别逼我进去! - 我不会保持沉默!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:38.41,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 这金牌所拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.49,0:29:42.99,cn,,0,0,0,,是你这个戴利设备的拉瑞·戴利 根本无法想象的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.23,0:29:47.17,cn,,0,0,0,,恢复生命只是其中一个小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:50.46,cn,,0,0,0,,有了它 我就可以开启尘封的地下世界之门
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:54.17,cn,,0,0,0,,从死亡之地召回我的军队
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:57.18,cn,,0,0,0,,如果不麻烦的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:02.08,cn,,0,0,0,,...把它给我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:06.22,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.72,0:30:09.31,cn,,0,0,0,,明智的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:15.32,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 很抱歉 我以为你是想要那个魔方 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.87,0:30:20.36,cn,,0,0,0,,魔方?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.60,0:30:24.47,cn,,0,0,0,,魔法立方体
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.27,0:30:32.94,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 这个魔法立方体是干什么的?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:37.98,cn,,0,0,0,,就是魔方 那个可以把你的敌人化成灰的魔方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.58,0:30:40.98,cn,,0,0,0,,有这个玩意儿吗?随便吧 总之...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.09,0:30:43.08,cn,,0,0,0,,是我不好 顺便说一句
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.16,0:30:44.78,cn,,0,0,0,,你弟弟也不想搞得这么砸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:46.22,cn,,0,0,0,,他不想两败俱伤
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:49.32,cn,,0,0,0,,只是 你看上去像比他厉害些 所以我...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:53.80,cn,,0,0,0,,我不是我弟弟 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.40,0:30:58.36,cn,,0,0,0,,只需一眨眼的功夫 我就能杀光你和你的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:04.07,cn,,0,0,0,,带我去那个魔法立方体
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:08.48,cn,,0,0,0,,- 就在这儿 - 打开
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.98,0:31:39.97,cn,,0,0,0,,回来!把金牌还给我!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:41.60,cn,,0,0,0,,你朋友还在我手上!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.62,0:32:22.61,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你来开! - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.72,0:32:26.21,cn,,0,0,0,,我说你来开 打起来了 打起来了 我爱它
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:28.35,cn,,0,0,0,,笔直往前 其他我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.43,0:32:30.45,cn,,0,0,0,,前进!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:41.36,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你有什么计划? - 我们是美国人 不计划 只做
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.44,0:32:43.20,cn,,0,0,0,,不要减速!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:58.18,cn,,0,0,0,,看到没有?先行而后思 每次都管用!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.26,0:32:59.62,cn,,0,0,0,,我可是好手!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.76,0:33:03.46,cn,,0,0,0,,美国第七骑兵队将军 乔治·阿姆斯特朗·卡斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.56,0:33:05.19,cn,,0,0,0,,为您效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:11.93,cn,,0,0,0,,我没事 继续开 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.45,0:33:23.81,cn,,0,0,0,,你们吵什么吵 牛仔?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:25.25,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 女士 你能让开吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.32,0:33:27.91,cn,,0,0,0,,女士? 你叫谁女士? 我是阿梅莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:36.99,cn,,0,0,0,,阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特 我想你听说过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:39.86,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 著名飞行员什么的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:42.66,cn,,0,0,0,,飞行员? 我可是第一个飞越大西洋的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.77,0:33:44.36,cn,,0,0,0,,第一个荣获飞行十字勋章的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:47.46,cn,,0,0,0,,第一个驾驶自转旋翼机 飞越美国48个州的女飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.54,0:33:50.37,cn,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话请先放下 你那副永远紧张兮兮的嘴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:54.67,cn,,0,0,0,,请告诉我我现在在哪儿 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.75,0:33:57.15,cn,,0,0,0,,你在一个博物馆 准确点是博物馆下面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.22,0:34:00.01,cn,,0,0,0,,我现在是众矢之的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.09,0:34:02.55,cn,,0,0,0,,所以你最好躲到离我远点的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:07.03,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你动作真快 - 你叫什么 飞行员?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.73,0:34:09.85,cn,,0,0,0,,我叫拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:12.83,cn,,0,0,0,,拉瑞·戴利 你给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.90,0:34:15.03,cn,,0,0,0,,我可不是个胆小怕事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.37,0:34:18.86,cn,,0,0,0,,那矛呢 你怕不怕矛呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:23.73,cn,,0,0,0,,让我们找点乐子 机长! 痛快玩一场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.35,0:34:31.51,cn,,0,0,0,,98 99 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.79,0:34:35.38,cn,,0,0,0,,像金羊毛一样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.29,0:34:39.88,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 士兵们 当你们的敌人抓住我的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.96,0:34:42.12,cn,,0,0,0,,他们也就成了我的瓮中之鳖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.90,0:34:45.59,cn,,0,0,0,,大错误 一个大错误
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:50.39,cn,,0,0,0,,我的计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.24,0:34:55.11,cn,,0,0,0,,吹响三声号角 我会大声宣布: "攻击!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.04,0:35:03.31,cn,,0,0,0,,然后我们全体跳出这个箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.05,0:35:06.61,cn,,0,0,0,,开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.23,0:35:17.09,cn,,0,0,0,,很震撼吧 觉得怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.60,0:35:22.09,cn,,0,0,0,,你说 萨什么什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.17,0:35:23.40,cn,,0,0,0,,那不是我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.47,0:35:25.49,cn,,0,0,0,,- 萨卡娅米尔 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.60,0:35:27.83,cn,,0,0,0,,- 娘娘腔 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.94,0:35:30.67,cn,,0,0,0,,- 死亡节日 - 我知道你是个著名的将军...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.78,0:35:33.11,cn,,0,0,0,,那算不上什么 我也是个普通人 和你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.78,0:35:36.34,cn,,0,0,0,,当你大叫"攻击"的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.45,0:35:37.94,cn,,0,0,0,,敌人不就立刻知道我们要攻击了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.45,0:35:39.78,cn,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.29,0:35:50.19,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 也许你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.20,0:35:58.07,cn,,0,0,0,,你很受欢迎嘛 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.14,0:35:59.63,cn,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不直接逃走?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.71,0:36:01.67,cn,,0,0,0,,我不能逃 我的朋友还在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.77,0:36:04.47,cn,,0,0,0,,我得去救他们 得另找一条路下去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.55,0:36:17.02,cn,,0,0,0,,以前没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.36,0:36:26.39,cn,,0,0,0,,没事 我不会伤害你们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.17,0:36:31.16,cn,,0,0,0,,我想他们怕的不是你 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.01,0:36:39.91,cn,,0,0,0,,交换 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.51,0:36:43.85,cn,,0,0,0,,退后 给我退后!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.05,0:36:46.68,cn,,0,0,0,,小心被我叉到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.02,0:36:48.51,cn,,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.36,0:36:53.05,cn,,0,0,0,,男人就是不如女人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:55.86,cn,,0,0,0,,我曾经用两周的时间 在密克罗尼西亚群岛和土著学习用矛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.76,0:36:59.79,cn,,0,0,0,,密克罗尼西亚人的反应没这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.54,0:37:04.83,cn,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.48,0:37:14.21,cn,,0,0,0,,战争结束了!战争结束了!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.78,0:37:20.48,cn,,0,0,0,,这儿可真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.13,0:37:28.99,cn,,0,0,0,,让一下 不好意思 让一让
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:33.06,cn,,0,0,0,,哇 1945年的信号这么强
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.13,0:37:34.66,cn,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 老爸 总算通了!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.77,0:37:36.39,cn,,0,0,0,,我一直在研究档案馆地形
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.67,0:37:38.07,cn,,0,0,0,,一旦你下了楼梯...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:40.11,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 我早就下了楼梯了 尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:42.30,cn,,0,0,0,,- 这么说你找到大家了? - 算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:44.27,cn,,0,0,0,,你在对着什么东西讲话?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:46.31,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那是谁? - 阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.41,0:37:48.07,cn,,0,0,0,,你找到了阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.15,0:37:49.31,cn,,0,0,0,,我...嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:53.28,cn,,0,0,0,,- 等会儿! - 老兄 你急什么啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.35,0:37:56.58,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你没听到吗? 战争结束啦! - 抱歉 那些人在追我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.66,0:37:59.49,cn,,0,0,0,,什么?都是些什么人啊 狂欢节表演吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.59,0:38:02.93,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪里来的? - 布鲁克林
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.00,0:38:07.30,cn,,0,0,0,,你说真的? 我是弗莱巴许的 嘿 兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:09.59,cn,,0,0,0,,那些怪人要打我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.67,0:38:11.00,cn,,0,0,0,,就因为他是布鲁克林的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.10,0:38:12.83,cn,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 别客气 给我打!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:18.27,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 先生!你忘了东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:24.54,cn,,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意儿? （请注意片尾曲中有相关情节）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.79,0:38:33.38,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 把她借我一会儿行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.96,0:38:39.86,cn,,0,0,0,,你吻完没有 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.07,0:38:42.80,cn,,0,0,0,,- 给我打电话! - 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.87,0:38:45.00,cn,,0,0,0,,你对付女人挺有一套啊 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.40,0:38:46.80,cn,,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:56.54,cn,,0,0,0,,- 终于挡住了 - 接下去干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.65,0:38:59.08,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 我不是针对你 不过我现在正处于水深火热中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.18,0:39:00.67,cn,,0,0,0,,这可不是你开飞机这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.75,0:39:02.48,cn,,0,0,0,,就因为我是个女人 对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.69,0:39:06.25,cn,,0,0,0,,不 因为有个死而复生的邪恶法老
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.36,0:39:09.38,cn,,0,0,0,,要我手上这块石板 他会杀了我甚至我身边的任何一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:10.72,cn,,0,0,0,,有了石板他就能统治世界
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.85,cn,,0,0,0,,所以说还是因为我是女人!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.93,0:39:14.23,cn,,0,0,0,,- 听着 我... - 不 你给我听着 戴利先生!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.33,0:39:16.73,cn,,0,0,0,,要不是我把你拉出来了 你现在还陷在那个黑白闹剧中
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:19.20,cn,,0,0,0,,- 陷在什么中? - 那张黑白照片 蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.27,0:39:21.43,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 听好了 我想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.54,0:39:24.53,cn,,0,0,0,,我想帮你 不是因为我喜欢你 我才不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.61,0:39:28.21,cn,,0,0,0,,而是因为我闻到了冒险的味道 见鬼 我要加入你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.35,0:39:32.78,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 出了事可别怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:34.85,cn,,0,0,0,,我的命长着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.92,0:39:40.42,cn,,0,0,0,,我是卡门拉 我是半个神
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:43.69,cn,,0,0,0,,从我出生开始
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.76,0:39:48.29,cn,,0,0,0,,我就是埃及王国的合法继承人 将来也要统治...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:50.86,cn,,0,0,0,,所有一切
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:54.03,cn,,0,0,0,,我损失了一些人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.64,0:39:59.70,cn,,0,0,0,,所以现在我需要一些帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.78,0:40:01.77,cn,,0,0,0,,和我一起征服世界
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.38,0:40:04.04,cn,,0,0,0,,恐怖的伊凡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.88,0:40:08.15,cn,,0,0,0,,拿破仑·波拿巴
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.25,0:40:10.24,cn,,0,0,0,,还有年轻的艾尔·卡彭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.38,cn,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.46,0:40:17.26,cn,,0,0,0,,你们都是历史上数一数二的大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.06,0:40:19.43,cn,,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:23.57,cn,,0,0,0,,真的 我真想不到能见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:25.13,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我们也是 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.57,0:40:30.51,cn,,0,0,0,,只要你们衷心于我 我承诺你们的是整个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.04,cn,,0,0,0,,你们有什么问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.15,0:40:36.05,cn,,0,0,0,,我有一个问题 你怎么会穿着裙子?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.32,0:40:38.65,cn,,0,0,0,,这不是裙子 这叫做袍子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.15,0:40:42.14,cn,,0,0,0,,3000年前很流行的 我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.55,0:40:43.99,cn,,0,0,0,,还有别的问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.06,0:40:47.79,cn,,0,0,0,,有 你穿的这个裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.86,0:40:50.12,cn,,0,0,0,,我们也要穿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.53,0:40:54.16,cn,,0,0,0,,你刚才没在听吗? 我已经回答了卡彭先生的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.23,0:40:55.86,cn,,0,0,0,,这不是裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.97,0:40:59.63,cn,,0,0,0,,事实上 这是件袍子 区别很大的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.51,0:41:02.50,cn,,0,0,0,,还有问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.48,cn,,0,0,0,,还有别的与裙子无关的问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:07.58,cn,,0,0,0,,袍子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.25,0:41:10.22,cn,,0,0,0,,那么好吧 不要浪费月色了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.32,0:41:12.34,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我们时间很短 - 短?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:15.72,cn,,0,0,0,,为什么你说"短"的时候要看着我?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.46,0:41:19.19,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我无意的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.59,0:41:25.32,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你说的是征服世界
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.40,0:41:27.23,cn,,0,0,0,,那我当然有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:31.10,cn,,0,0,0,,不过我想先澄清一件事情 你得搞清楚你在和谁合作
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:34.77,cn,,0,0,0,,人们总是说: 伊凡很恐怖 他很吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.87,0:41:37.57,cn,,0,0,0,,我很怕伊凡 他是个恶棍
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.68,0:41:40.51,cn,,0,0,0,,其实正确的翻译应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.35,0:41:43.44,cn,,0,0,0,,令人畏惧的伊凡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.55,0:41:46.18,cn,,0,0,0,,令人畏惧的伊凡?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:48.84,cn,,0,0,0,,那个比较难记 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:51.79,cn,,0,0,0,,我是说 恐怖的伊凡更容易记
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:55.55,cn,,0,0,0,,可是我一点都不恐怖 事实上我是个很能干的领袖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.63,0:41:59.29,cn,,0,0,0,,好我记住了 现在我想用一个问题来结束
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.40,0:42:01.73,cn,,0,0,0,,今晚的面谈会
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.80,0:42:04.10,cn,,0,0,0,,你们跟不跟我?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.54,0:42:06.03,cn,,0,0,0,,- 跟 跟 - 跟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.27,0:42:10.87,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我跟 不过... - 那就把戴利设备的拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:13.91,cn,,0,0,0,,还有阿卡曼拉的复活金牌弄来给我!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.55,cn,,0,0,0,,我带你下去找你的朋友 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:22.21,cn,,0,0,0,,跟着阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特 你绝对不会迷路
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.39,0:42:24.79,cn,,0,0,0,,快点 蹲下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.26,0:42:31.23,cn,,0,0,0,,戴利先生 我很喜欢你这么搂着我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.90,0:42:35.39,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是那个意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:37.46,cn,,0,0,0,,拜托你戴利先生 别嘟嘟囔囔的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.57,0:42:39.80,cn,,0,0,0,,自打你看到我那刻起
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.91,0:42:41.50,cn,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛就没离开过我的飞机底盘
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.61,0:42:43.91,cn,,0,0,0,,你说的话我全部听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.58,0:42:51.14,cn,,0,0,0,,是我听错了还是有人在唱歌?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.25,0:42:55.78,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ ...宝贝 我们可以将它照耀 我们可以永远... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.85,0:42:58.69,cn,,0,0,0,,你们 会飞的小天使 安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.79,0:43:01.32,cn,,0,0,0,,他们是丘比特 戴利先生 是爱神
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.43,0:43:05.12,cn,,0,0,0,,太棒了 爱神 你们能闭嘴吗? 闭嘴 我们会暴露的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.37,0:43:09.06,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ 耶 特别的女人 耶 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.67,0:43:14.37,cn,,0,0,0,,别换了 不是编曲的问题 给我安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.01,0:43:16.37,cn,,0,0,0,,大家一起唱!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.48,0:43:18.10,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ 特别的女人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.44,0:43:20.47,cn,,0,0,0,,让我看看你的能耐 守卫!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.55,0:43:21.88,cn,,0,0,0,,快点 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.98,0:43:24.61,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ 对我来说是个特别的女人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.52,0:43:27.18,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ 特别的女人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.29,0:43:29.62,cn,,0,0,0,,∮ 她是个特别的女人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.19,0:43:41.00,cn,,0,0,0,,你这只小到不能再小的小老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.07,0:43:43.83,cn,,0,0,0,,自动跑到大猫咪的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.24,0:43:46.67,cn,,0,0,0,,你真的这么在乎高度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.74,0:43:48.57,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我根本不在乎高度... - 不 你在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.64,0:43:50.67,cn,,0,0,0,,你的意思是我只是一只小老鼠 而你是一只大猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.74,0:43:53.73,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我是大猫咪 - 我并不想冒犯你 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.85,0:43:56.75,cn,,0,0,0,,你是拿破仑 你拥有很多很多的形容词
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.85,0:43:58.94,cn,,0,0,0,,矮就是其中之一 真的 你自己看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.05,0:44:01.61,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 你这个幼稚的美国男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:04.59,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 现在讨论这个很无聊好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.69,0:44:07.02,cn,,0,0,0,,我们不该浪费时间... 在这个不值一提的问题上
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.09,0:44:11.62,cn,,0,0,0,,人不是以高矮来评价的 是头脑 一个伟大的头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:14.79,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你是很有头脑 - 说的好 皇帝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.04,0:44:18.50,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.57,0:44:21.73,cn,,0,0,0,,如果你的男朋友能合作点 跟我走...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.81,0:44:23.21,cn,,0,0,0,,我不是她男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.21,0:44:26.91,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不是男朋友 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.21,0:44:28.70,cn,,0,0,0,,普通朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.25,0:44:35.38,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是 普通朋友 - 只是认识而已 普通朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.82,0:44:39.48,cn,,0,0,0,,你们的关系 是不是类似那种大学同学
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.59,0:44:42.06,cn,,0,0,0,,相互暗恋 想要更进一步发展
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.13,0:44:44.49,cn,,0,0,0,,但却不敢告诉对方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.60,0:44:46.12,cn,,0,0,0,,怕毁了你们现在的关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.67,0:44:51.76,cn,,0,0,0,,再说一遍好吗 抱歉 我没听明白...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.67,0:44:54.30,cn,,0,0,0,,你们的关系 是不是类似那种大学同学
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.41,0:44:56.24,cn,,0,0,0,,相互暗恋 想更进一步发展
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.31,0:44:59.07,cn,,0,0,0,,但却不敢告诉对方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.14,0:45:01.17,cn,,0,0,0,,怕毁了你们现在的关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.92,0:45:05.68,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.78,0:45:08.84,cn,,0,0,0,,我喜欢挖掘两性关系的本质 这是法国人的爱好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.95,0:45:10.51,cn,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 是啊 爱情
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:11.85,cn,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.96,0:45:14.26,cn,,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 要不就杀了你 - 遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.63,0:45:22.00,cn,,0,0,0,,- 等等 我也去 - 不! 这事与你无关
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:29.30,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你还得再下一次注 - 好 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:33.91,cn,,0,0,0,,我的发型在欧洲一带流通很广
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.01,0:45:37.07,cn,,0,0,0,,真的 流通很广 就像黄金和钱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.75,0:45:40.08,cn,,0,0,0,,一小盒能买下整个大教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.22,0:45:41.55,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:45.49,cn,,0,0,0,,这个马戏团小丑 连煎饼和苍蝇拍都分不清
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:47.86,cn,,0,0,0,,现在铁人正在外面为我们拼命
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.93,0:45:49.89,cn,,0,0,0,,至少我们要帮他一把
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:54.66,cn,,0,0,0,,我们能帮大忙 但是在这里坐以待毙就什么忙也帮不上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.73,0:45:57.10,cn,,0,0,0,,我们得逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.20,0:45:59.36,cn,,0,0,0,,煎饼是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.44,0:46:01.87,cn,,0,0,0,,类似一种饼干或者面包的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.94,0:46:04.34,cn,,0,0,0,,- 碰胸 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.41,0:46:07.17,cn,,0,0,0,,你玩完了 看牌
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.58,0:46:10.28,cn,,0,0,0,,看好你的牌 现在下注吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.85,0:46:12.94,cn,,0,0,0,,现在你得丢点牌下来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.42,0:46:17.29,cn,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了? - 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.62,0:46:21.56,cn,,0,0,0,,说点什么 说点什么 这不好玩 你必须...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.80,0:46:26.20,cn,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你们俩想干嘛? - 奥克塔维厄斯 跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.26,0:46:29.39,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你 快跑 我掩护你 - 我不会一个人跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:32.73,cn,,0,0,0,,现在不是演罗马连续剧 快跑 马上!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.21,0:46:34.70,cn,,0,0,0,,老杰迪戴亚不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:36.07,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 你麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.78,0:46:43.41,cn,,0,0,0,,这些根本不是真的红宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.15,0:46:45.98,cn,,0,0,0,,真品红宝石鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.89,0:46:53.88,cn,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道这个阿奇·巴克是谁 但这椅子坐的可真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.89,0:46:56.22,cn,,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.29,0:46:59.56,cn,,0,0,0,,这家伙从箱子的一个锈洞里逃出来 给我们抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.63,0:47:01.46,cn,,0,0,0,,还有一个跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.57,0:47:05.09,cn,,0,0,0,,拜托 他们能干得了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.17,0:47:09.11,cn,,0,0,0,,看看 他们小的好像一粒米 是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.17,0:47:11.40,cn,,0,0,0,,听你说话我想到了两个词
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.81,0:47:13.94,cn,,0,0,0,,神经病 精神分裂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.51,0:47:17.88,cn,,0,0,0,,如果还要说第三个词的话 那就是"蠢猪"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:21.88,cn,,0,0,0,,你快把老杰迪戴亚放出来 不然他可要发火了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.29,0:47:23.88,cn,,0,0,0,,说的好 杰迪戴亚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:27.69,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我实在认真不起来 你太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.19,0:47:30.39,cn,,0,0,0,,连你威胁我的样子也有趣极了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.50,0:47:34.63,cn,,0,0,0,,是我的问题 还是这些小家伙真是可爱的要命
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.70,0:47:35.83,cn,,0,0,0,,你给我省省吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.90,0:47:38.63,cn,,0,0,0,,你可以囚禁我 甚至折磨我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.70,0:47:41.14,cn,,0,0,0,,但不许说我可爱 我不可爱!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.21,0:47:46.23,cn,,0,0,0,,撑住 我的朋友! 坚持住 我会救你出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.35,0:47:53.51,cn,,0,0,0,,铁人 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.15,0:47:58.38,cn,,0,0,0,,你好 戴利先生 很高兴再一次见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.83,0:48:03.59,cn,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 这个我要拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:05.56,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.70,0:48:11.16,cn,,0,0,0,,终于!过了整整3000年
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.67,0:48:18.37,cn,,0,0,0,,我被诅咒的黑暗军团 我可爱的军团
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.44,0:48:23.21,cn,,0,0,0,,将重见天日!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.36,0:48:34.35,cn,,0,0,0,,我恐怕妈妈和爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.43,0:48:37.36,cn,,0,0,0,,背着我稍稍改了一下密码
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.90,0:48:40.87,cn,,0,0,0,,这么说地下怪物重见天日这套
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.93,0:48:43.20,cn,,0,0,0,,行不通了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.27,0:48:46.47,cn,,0,0,0,,你一定很难过吧 毕竟你都等了几千年了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.57,0:48:48.37,cn,,0,0,0,,好不容易死而复生
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:51.81,cn,,0,0,0,,却打不开地狱之门
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.54,0:48:55.78,cn,,0,0,0,,我不怕 有必要的话我还可以再等上一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.88,0:48:59.94,cn,,0,0,0,,很好 不过再过几个小时你就会 变成一尊沮丧的雕塑
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.05,0:49:03.65,cn,,0,0,0,,冻在那里 而我可以带着我的朋友们 离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.76,0:49:04.88,cn,,0,0,0,,所以 我不介意等上一整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.46,0:49:08.55,cn,,0,0,0,,真的吗?一整晚?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.09,0:49:10.58,cn,,0,0,0,,他等不了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:21.80,cn,,0,0,0,,打开笼子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.91,0:49:24.97,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛? - 不许碰我!不许碰我!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.08,0:49:26.51,cn,,0,0,0,,你敢对我动粗试试
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.95,0:49:29.74,cn,,0,0,0,,- 看呐 小家伙生气了 - 杰德?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.08,0:49:34.11,cn,,0,0,0,,别动 别动 不然你会更难受
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.19,0:49:36.42,cn,,0,0,0,,- 放开他! - 别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.49,0:49:38.08,cn,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.12,0:49:40.49,cn,,0,0,0,,我骗你了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.83,0:49:45.19,cn,,0,0,0,,我想他可等不了一整晚 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.76,0:49:50.03,cn,,0,0,0,,看这速度 他只剩不到一个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.14,0:49:51.76,cn,,0,0,0,,放我出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.54,0:49:57.60,cn,,0,0,0,,你是守卫! 你很了解这块复活金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:50:00.87,cn,,0,0,0,,而你看上去也比我们这里所有人都聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.95,0:50:03.04,cn,,0,0,0,,不管你知道还是不知道密码
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.15,0:50:06.41,cn,,0,0,0,,我给你一个小时的时间去想
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:09.45,cn,,0,0,0,,到时间不给我密码 我就杀光你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:13.48,cn,,0,0,0,,还有你别想溜 我会监视你的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.56,0:50:15.36,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 我根本无从下手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.46,0:50:17.62,cn,,0,0,0,,我完全不懂怎么破译密码 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.70,0:50:19.32,cn,,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.40,0:50:23.23,cn,,0,0,0,,你的牛仔小朋友看上去那么惹人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.57,0:50:29.47,cn,,0,0,0,,时间在走哦 戴利先生 轮到你行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.54,0:50:34.34,cn,,0,0,0,,我挺你 伙计 我知道你行的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.49,0:50:44.72,cn,,0,0,0,,我挺你!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.60,0:50:55.09,cn,,0,0,0,,你来了!你还好吗? 我都快担心死了!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.17,0:50:57.96,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 下一步计划是什么 拍档?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.04,0:51:00.70,cn,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 我必须先破译密码
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.17,0:51:03.77,cn,,0,0,0,,哦好极了 又是这家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.84,0:51:06.68,cn,,0,0,0,,听着伙计 我不想惹麻烦好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.79,0:51:19.12,cn,,0,0,0,,看呐
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.22,0:51:22.75,cn,,0,0,0,,看来章鱼先生只是太缺水了 它也只条普通的鱼类
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.63,0:51:25.60,cn,,0,0,0,,看上去也没那么讨厌嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.60,0:51:31.97,cn,,0,0,0,,好 知道你很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.35,0:51:43.64,cn,,0,0,0,,喂 帮个忙好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.48,0:51:46.47,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 泰德 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.58,0:51:47.71,cn,,0,0,0,,也许你能帮我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.79,0:51:49.38,cn,,0,0,0,,我很愿意帮忙 但先帮我解决我的燃眉之急
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.45,0:51:51.79,cn,,0,0,0,,鼻子痒的我快疯掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.89,0:51:55.16,cn,,0,0,0,,我知道这很无礼 不过我看上去有点缺胳膊少腿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.26,0:51:58.46,cn,,0,0,0,,- 可以帮我挠一下吗? - 当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.43,0:52:02.46,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 对是这里 再过去一点...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.57,0:52:03.76,cn,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了! - 还要?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.84,0:52:06.10,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 是的 是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.81,0:52:09.33,cn,,0,0,0,,终于舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.84,0:52:11.40,cn,,0,0,0,,西奥多·罗斯福很高兴为你效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.78,0:52:14.34,cn,,0,0,0,,这是美国第二十六届总统 狂野骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:16.47,cn,,0,0,0,,他建造了国家公园 还有很多别的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.92,0:52:20.61,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我们认识吗? - 不 还有另一个泰德
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.69,0:52:25.25,cn,,0,0,0,,- 纽约博物馆也有一个你 - 真的? 长什么样? 像我一样?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.46,0:52:28.59,cn,,0,0,0,,差不多 只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.66,0:52:30.75,cn,,0,0,0,,只是什么?只是他多了个身体?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.83,0:52:33.26,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是 他有身体 - 哦 见鬼 你刺激到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.87,0:52:35.70,cn,,0,0,0,,- 还有一匹马 - 打断一下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.80,0:52:38.43,cn,,0,0,0,,我们需要翻译这块石板上的文字
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.84,0:52:42.03,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你看得懂象形文字吗? - 是 我懂 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.14,0:52:43.87,cn,,0,0,0,,这很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.98,0:52:48.00,cn,,0,0,0,,鸟 拿矛的人 斜过来的鱼 甲虫 花瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.88,0:52:50.71,cn,,0,0,0,,那这代表什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.82,0:52:53.88,cn,,0,0,0,,我只是粗略的翻译一下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.79,0:52:58.88,cn,,0,0,0,,一个拿矛的男人在一个花瓶里 抓住了一只鸟和一条斜过来的鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.23,0:53:02.89,cn,,0,0,0,,还有一只甲虫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.96,0:53:07.93,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我想你是胡说八道 - 那只是其中一种译法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.00,0:53:09.52,cn,,0,0,0,,另一种译法是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:11.57,cn,,0,0,0,,只要能解开法老墓穴深处的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.64,0:53:15.47,cn,,0,0,0,,你就能破译密码
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.87,0:53:18.71,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 这是什么意思? - 不知道 我又不是狮身人面像
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.78,0:53:21.01,cn,,0,0,0,,"这是什么" "那是什么" 你们怎么不去问纽约那个泰德
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:23.48,cn,,0,0,0,,我打赌他会拿他贪婪的双手摸遍这块东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:25.18,cn,,0,0,0,,可能还会让他的马舔两下!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.25,0:53:27.65,cn,,0,0,0,,戴利先生 我们应该去雕塑馆
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.72,0:53:29.88,cn,,0,0,0,,那儿有个人也许真的能帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.66,0:53:32.62,cn,,0,0,0,,我们要找的人就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.69,0:53:36.02,cn,,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 你好 年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.53,0:53:39.59,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉 能快点走吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:42.72,cn,,0,0,0,,当然可以 但我不想错过这么好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.83,0:53:45.36,cn,,0,0,0,,这可是德加的作品 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.44,0:53:47.60,cn,,0,0,0,,我的小朋友被困在沙漏里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.71,0:53:49.43,cn,,0,0,0,,明天一早我还有个棘手的会议 对方是沃尔玛...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.54,0:53:52.91,cn,,0,0,0,,- 请快点好吗... - 他就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.78,0:53:55.44,cn,,0,0,0,,我认为他肯定知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.78,0:53:58.68,cn,,0,0,0,,思想者先生 抱歉打断你的沉思
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.75,0:54:03.18,cn,,0,0,0,,我们想知道法老墓穴深处的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.25,0:54:06.42,cn,,0,0,0,,我在思考 我在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.89,0:54:09.42,cn,,0,0,0,,我在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.36,0:54:14.80,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我在思考 - 问他没用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.50,0:54:16.83,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.27,cn,,0,0,0,,没开玩笑吧 看看!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.61,0:54:24.23,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.31,0:54:25.97,cn,,0,0,0,,伙计 看这儿! 这很要紧!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:27.88,cn,,0,0,0,,对 生死攸关
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.28,0:54:30.11,cn,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你什么叫生死攸关
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.22,0:54:31.91,cn,,0,0,0,,看到那个美女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.98,0:54:35.44,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿宝贝 看看我的肌肉秀
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.96,0:54:38.48,cn,,0,0,0,,猛男!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.89,0:54:40.95,cn,,0,0,0,,看来他没爱因斯坦那种脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.06,0:54:43.89,cn,,0,0,0,,- 二头肌!三角肌... - 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.96,0:54:47.23,cn,,0,0,0,,- 等等 我见过一堆那个 - 一堆什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.30,0:54:49.10,cn,,0,0,0,,- 小爱因斯坦 - 在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.13,0:54:52.13,cn,,0,0,0,,在航天航空馆
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.00,0:54:54.73,cn,,0,0,0,,得马上过去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.27,0:54:56.40,cn,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.47,0:54:59.97,cn,,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 那你这么盯着我干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:02.31,cn,,0,0,0,,我不想浪费一秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.41,0:55:04.75,cn,,0,0,0,,好的 很好 不过我们得快点 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.92,0:55:08.39,cn,,0,0,0,,- 干什么? - 你太啰嗦了 牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.42,0:55:14.82,cn,,0,0,0,,我也不知道我为什么吻你 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.93,0:55:18.02,cn,,0,0,0,,我只觉得我好像沉睡了很久很久
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.43,0:55:19.66,cn,,0,0,0,,突然之间 我醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.93,0:55:21.80,cn,,0,0,0,,我可以解释...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.67,0:55:24.43,cn,,0,0,0,,真的 我可以解释...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.30,0:55:26.86,cn,,0,0,0,,又打我 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.11,0:55:33.44,cn,,0,0,0,,太好了 你们又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.05,0:55:40.45,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 唱得好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.52,0:55:43.61,cn,,0,0,0,,泰坦尼克的主题曲 唱得很好 谢谢你们帮倒忙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.46,0:55:50.19,cn,,0,0,0,,你就不会享受人生吗 戴利先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.36,0:55:54.26,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 不是你们选错歌了 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.33,0:55:56.20,cn,,0,0,0,,还有 你们真的很烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:59.36,cn,,0,0,0,,我觉得你们很棒 可爱极了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.04,0:56:02.94,cn,,0,0,0,,飞远点 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.78,0:56:05.54,cn,,0,0,0,,冒险继续
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.51,0:56:11.71,cn,,0,0,0,,叫你们别吵了 聋了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.92,0:56:24.19,cn,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我感觉自己 像只翩翩起舞的蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.63,0:56:27.12,cn,,0,0,0,,你像只臭蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.23,0:56:31.26,cn,,0,0,0,,埃及先生 这两个人听说我们要征服世界
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.37,0:56:34.30,cn,,0,0,0,,他们想加入 虽然我不认识他们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.41,0:56:37.77,cn,,0,0,0,,但他们也是这里的展品
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.64,0:56:40.80,cn,,0,0,0,,他们到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.91,0:56:46.04,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们这儿坏人的名额满了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.12,0:56:49.28,cn,,0,0,0,,别呀!我很坏 我真的很坏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.39,0:56:51.88,cn,,0,0,0,,让你看看我有多坏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:54.99,cn,,0,0,0,,怕我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.10,0:56:58.76,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我没被吓到
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.83,0:57:03.27,cn,,0,0,0,,你看上去不坏 只是脾气有点差而已
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.17,0:57:05.57,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.27,0:57:09.93,cn,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?这是什么?这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.01,0:57:12.27,cn,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?我搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.34,0:57:16.01,cn,,0,0,0,,这是你呼吸的声音吗? 吵得我都快不能思考了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.75,0:57:19.77,cn,,0,0,0,,让我给你一个建议吧 朋友 别再添乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.85,0:57:22.29,cn,,0,0,0,,这里已经够乱的了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.35,0:57:26.85,cn,,0,0,0,,你很邪恶 你有哮喘 你是个机器人 还有你这斗篷是干嘛的?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.96,0:57:29.52,cn,,0,0,0,,我们这儿又不是在演话剧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.63,0:57:31.75,cn,,0,0,0,,不好意思!再见
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.83,0:57:33.35,cn,,0,0,0,,有情况!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.46,0:57:35.33,cn,,0,0,0,,他带着金牌逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.03,0:57:37.59,cn,,0,0,0,,哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.94,0:57:40.37,cn,,0,0,0,,让我看
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.94,0:57:44.97,cn,,0,0,0,,他不是在想密码 他要逃跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.04,0:57:49.10,cn,,0,0,0,,所有人给我追 杀了他! 把金牌带回来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.35,0:57:52.87,cn,,0,0,0,,行动起来 快 金牌是我们一切的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.98,0:57:54.71,cn,,0,0,0,,士兵们 上!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.32,0:58:00.72,cn,,0,0,0,,你逃不出我的手掌 拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.17,0:58:10.73,cn,,0,0,0,,老天 我们玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.84,0:58:12.96,cn,,0,0,0,,- 玩完了? 是吗? - 我就是这么说话的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.04,0:58:15.30,cn,,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思 就是听上去有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.37,0:58:19.47,cn,,0,0,0,,"不 不 我们的路被坏人堵住了" 这么说还有什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.64,0:58:22.31,cn,,0,0,0,,问题是我们现在去不了航天航空馆了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:24.41,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你说的对 我们玩完了 - 玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:26.25,cn,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.23,0:58:38.56,cn,,0,0,0,,他们都说那个总统是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.16,0:58:41.50,cn,,0,0,0,,我答应过杰迪戴亚我会找人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.03,0:58:44.00,cn,,0,0,0,,我一定会找到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:50.84,cn,,0,0,0,,进攻!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.86,0:59:05.76,cn,,0,0,0,,低估这段距离了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.63,0:59:11.06,cn,,0,0,0,,谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.93,0:59:18.56,cn,,0,0,0,,朱庇特神 求你护佑我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.31,0:59:26.33,cn,,0,0,0,,一动不动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:29.38,cn,,0,0,0,,他们对移动很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.98,0:59:34.32,cn,,0,0,0,,显然 他们也能听到我自言自语
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:38.55,cn,,0,0,0,,我不是坚果
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.22,0:59:41.82,cn,,0,0,0,,不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.73,0:59:50.79,cn,,0,0,0,,在这里躲一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:58.10,cn,,0,0,0,,你当守卫多久了?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.18,1:00:00.84,cn,,0,0,0,,什么?哦 其实我不在这儿工作...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.95,1:00:02.74,cn,,0,0,0,,你的装备看上去很齐全 所以我以为...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.45,1:00:04.94,cn,,0,0,0,,这是我借的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.45,1:00:09.98,cn,,0,0,0,,我在纽约确实当过守卫 那是很久以前了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.76,1:00:14.02,cn,,0,0,0,,为什么不干了?不喜欢了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.13,1:00:15.75,cn,,0,0,0,,不 我爱这份工作 只是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.83,1:00:18.69,cn,,0,0,0,,人生往另一个方向在发展 所以...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.80,1:00:22.25,cn,,0,0,0,,- 那你现在的工作是什么? - 怎么说呢...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:26.00,cn,,0,0,0,,我发明产品然后销售出去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.44,1:00:28.20,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你是发明家! - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.31,1:00:30.17,cn,,0,0,0,,我是个发明家 发明东西
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.44,1:00:31.97,cn,,0,0,0,,比如火箭?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.04,1:00:33.70,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 水上飞机?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.81,1:00:36.61,cn,,0,0,0,,- 飞船? - 不 不是飞行器
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.68,1:00:39.48,cn,,0,0,0,,小一点的东西 比如...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.82,1:00:43.78,cn,,0,0,0,,比如夜光手电筒 那是我的发明
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.79,1:00:47.49,cn,,0,0,0,,那么你喜欢这份新工作吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.06,1:00:51.65,cn,,0,0,0,,是 我很喜欢 很刺激...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.30,1:00:55.56,cn,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 我只是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.67,1:00:57.86,cn,,0,0,0,,既然你一点都不兴奋 那你为什么干那个?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.37,1:01:02.07,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我很兴奋 我只是... - 别瞒我了 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.17,1:01:05.51,cn,,0,0,0,,我眼前这个人很明显已经丧失了激情
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.81,1:01:08.97,cn,,0,0,0,,我没有...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.31,1:01:11.14,cn,,0,0,0,,我很有激情
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.48,1:01:13.01,cn,,0,0,0,,知道我为什么当飞行员吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.69,1:01:17.55,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 因为那充满乐趣
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:20.56,cn,,0,0,0,,没有乐趣人生还有什么意义?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.20,1:01:25.75,cn,,0,0,0,,了不起的盖茨比!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.26,1:01:30.83,cn,,0,0,0,,走开 你们这些叫个不停的鸽子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.90,1:01:33.84,cn,,0,0,0,,- 别! 总统先生! - 好了 是时候看看...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.90,1:01:37.17,cn,,0,0,0,,- 请别起来! - 我们伟大的联邦了! 我总是说
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.24,1:01:40.94,cn,,0,0,0,,今天能干完的事就别留到明天
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.05,1:01:43.07,cn,,0,0,0,,先生 你出去会吓倒一片人的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.18,1:01:46.95,cn,,0,0,0,,吓人?胡说八道 我不是怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.05,1:01:51.45,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我不是说你是怪物... - 行了 小东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.36,1:01:55.59,cn,,0,0,0,,真要说吓人的话 你才吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.09,1:01:58.93,cn,,0,0,0,,你也实在是太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.03,1:02:01.73,cn,,0,0,0,,和正常人比你也算矮小的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:04.56,cn,,0,0,0,,什么?为什么这么说?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.87,1:02:07.03,cn,,0,0,0,,我是实话实说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.10,1:02:10.47,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 你很诚实 你说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.57,1:02:12.87,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 总统先生 把小家伙放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.94,1:02:15.21,cn,,0,0,0,,把你的屁股放回你的宝座上
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.28,1:02:18.77,cn,,0,0,0,,既然你那么坚定 那我就照办吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.88,1:02:20.48,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:22.65,cn,,0,0,0,,- 站好了 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.75,1:02:27.16,cn,,0,0,0,,坚定不移正是我们民族的伟大精神
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.26,1:02:28.75,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我讲个故事 - 他们追来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.83,1:02:30.12,cn,,0,0,0,,有一天晚上在盖兹堡...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.23,1:02:31.96,cn,,0,0,0,,总统先生 请你先别动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.06,1:02:33.79,cn,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 亚伯拉罕 不许动!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.90,1:02:35.66,cn,,0,0,0,,不许动? 我...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.94,1:02:45.00,cn,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.11,1:02:47.60,cn,,0,0,0,,- 快 我们去航天航空馆 - 允许我说一句
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.68,1:02:51.11,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你们俩真是太相配了 - 不 我们不配...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:52.84,cn,,0,0,0,,不 你搞错了...我们不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.95,1:02:56.15,cn,,0,0,0,,什么不配不配 少来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.25,1:02:57.78,cn,,0,0,0,,我从不撒谎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.12,1:03:01.65,cn,,0,0,0,,事实就是 你们俩个在一起太相配了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.76,1:03:03.19,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢 晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.29,1:03:08.76,cn,,0,0,0,,再见 美丽的女士还有小个子男人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.21,1:03:10.30,cn,,0,0,0,,(航天航空馆)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.30,1:03:12.97,cn,,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到你说的爱因斯坦们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.42,1:03:32.89,cn,,0,0,0,,我的一小步 是人类的一大步
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.59,1:03:38.59,cn,,0,0,0,,华盛顿 这里是航天航空馆 全体启动 全速运行
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.70,1:03:47.76,cn,,0,0,0,,黑色轰炸机又一次开始行军
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.84,1:03:51.83,cn,,0,0,0,,不用直播我们的每一个行动吧 享受当前的时刻吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.38,1:03:55.47,cn,,0,0,0,,黑色轰炸机正在享受当前的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.55,1:03:56.98,cn,,0,0,0,,- 埃尔哈特小姐 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:03:59.21,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我想对你表示感谢 - 谢我什么 上尉?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.32,1:04:01.58,cn,,0,0,0,,很多人都认为我们成不了飞行员
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.69,1:04:03.85,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢你让大家改变了想法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.36,1:04:09.59,cn,,0,0,0,,- 比比谁先到巴黎? - 接受挑战!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.69,1:04:11.02,cn,,0,0,0,,不 现在不行 我们...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.10,1:04:13.36,cn,,0,0,0,,- 打个来回很快的 - 不行 我们是来找爱因斯坦的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.43,1:04:16.52,cn,,0,0,0,,快点 我们没时间了 快
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:18.93,cn,,0,0,0,,抱歉 看到飞机我就忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.67,1:04:21.26,cn,,0,0,0,,看那儿 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.37,1:04:25.00,cn,,0,0,0,,老贝茜 我的老搭档了 她带着我飞越了大西洋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.08,1:04:27.04,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 不过爱因斯坦在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:29.81,cn,,0,0,0,,这里是指挥中心 起飞检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.88,1:04:32.37,cn,,0,0,0,,- 他们去哪儿了? - 发射准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.45,1:04:33.92,cn,,0,0,0,,起飞!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.02,1:04:35.92,cn,,0,0,0,,华盛顿 这里是控制中心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.69,1:04:39.78,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不! - 所有系统检查完毕 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.89,1:04:42.36,cn,,0,0,0,,收到 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.43,1:04:45.19,cn,,0,0,0,,不 绝对不能发射!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.26,1:04:49.06,cn,,0,0,0,,- 到底发射不发射 - 我说不发射
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.13,1:04:50.23,cn,,0,0,0,,发射!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.80,1:04:52.27,cn,,0,0,0,,发射!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.04,1:04:55.03,cn,,0,0,0,,- 发射! - 不! 不能发射!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.61,1:04:57.30,cn,,0,0,0,,启动最大扭矩
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.41,1:04:59.47,cn,,0,0,0,,别放大扭矩 降低扭矩
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.58,1:05:01.14,cn,,0,0,0,,降低扭矩 降低扭矩
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.05,1:05:04.88,cn,,0,0,0,,开始点火倒计时
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.95,1:05:07.47,cn,,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 收到发射指令
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.59,1:05:09.75,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 不! - 十
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.82,1:05:12.08,cn,,0,0,0,,九 八 七...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.16,1:05:14.25,cn,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 那是我的 - 不 没有发射指令
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.33,1:05:17.26,cn,,0,0,0,,重复 没有发射指令
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.33,1:05:22.99,cn,,0,0,0,,发射指令无效 禁止发射 禁止起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.10,1:05:27.80,cn,,0,0,0,,严禁任何起飞行为!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.91,1:05:29.77,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧! - 祝各位晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.84,1:05:32.37,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 干得好 完毕 解散
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.74,1:05:35.68,cn,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 见鬼 真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.75,1:05:37.71,cn,,0,0,0,,来吧 我请你喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.45,1:05:40.18,cn,,0,0,0,,你好 太空猴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.19,1:05:46.12,cn,,0,0,0,,你叫亚伯 很好 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.76,1:05:48.62,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 很好 稍息 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.49,1:05:52.86,cn,,0,0,0,,你非常有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.96,1:05:56.09,cn,,0,0,0,,你知道那些爱因斯坦摇头娃娃在哪儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.40,1:05:59.87,cn,,0,0,0,,戴利先生! 我找到爱因斯坦了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.54,1:06:01.80,cn,,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.87,1:06:05.50,cn,,0,0,0,,先生们 我们需要你们帮我们 破译这块金牌的密码
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.61,1:06:08.10,cn,,0,0,0,,金牌上的文字告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.18,1:06:11.64,cn,,0,0,0,,要破译密码必须破译法老墓穴深处的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.65,1:06:16.48,cn,,0,0,0,,很简单 答案就蕴含在问题中
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.99,1:06:18.82,cn,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思? - 破译
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.89,1:06:21.48,cn,,0,0,0,,就是计算 比如 一个数字
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.56,1:06:24.39,cn,,0,0,0,,法老的墓穴 就是金字塔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.50,1:06:27.06,cn,,0,0,0,,还不明白吗 孩子? 你们要找的就是藏在金字塔中的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.16,1:06:29.03,cn,,0,0,0,,那串神秘数字
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.53,1:06:31.83,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 我懂了 答案就是圆周率!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.17,1:06:35.73,cn,,0,0,0,,- 圆周率? - 3.14159265 精确的来说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.84,1:06:38.90,cn,,0,0,0,,对! 3.1495265
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.01,1:06:42.07,cn,,0,0,0,,不是 是3.14159265
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:44.24,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 3.14...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.92,1:06:47.35,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 我实在分不清 你们是在点头还是摇头...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.42,1:06:49.15,cn,,0,0,0,,我知道这对你们很难 能不能...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.22,1:06:50.55,cn,,0,0,0,,别碰头发
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.65,1:06:54.22,cn,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 你们晃得我头晕... - 我是摇头娃娃 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.33,1:06:57.49,cn,,0,0,0,,我们就爱摇头晃脑 一起说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.56,1:07:01.59,cn,,0,0,0,,我们就爱摇头晃脑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.70,1:07:03.69,cn,,0,0,0,,知道吗 不是人人都能当爱因斯坦...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.77,1:07:04.93,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我能! - 我们是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.04,1:07:06.56,cn,,0,0,0,,- 他是 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.67,1:07:08.43,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好 我再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.54,1:07:11.01,cn,,0,0,0,,- 可不可以说慢一点 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.24,cn,,0,0,0,,3.14159265
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.35,1:07:16.84,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好的 3.14... - 我记住了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.45,1:07:19.38,cn,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 爱因斯坦先生 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.68,1:07:26.21,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 作为一名伟大的将军
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.29,1:07:28.38,cn,,0,0,0,,经过一番深思熟虑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.46,1:07:32.45,cn,,0,0,0,,我又想出了全新的升级版作战计划
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.90,1:07:36.26,cn,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.53,1:07:41.53,cn,,0,0,0,,我会大声宣布
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.61,1:07:44.47,cn,,0,0,0,,全体不攻击 然后...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.38,1:07:46.81,cn,,0,0,0,,等待时机
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.91,1:07:52.04,cn,,0,0,0,,然后大家随便闲扯 突然
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.72,1:07:54.21,cn,,0,0,0,,发动攻击!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.82,1:08:01.42,cn,,0,0,0,,没想到你的朋友自己逃命去了吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.79,1:08:04.12,cn,,0,0,0,,他会回来的 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.23,1:08:07.99,cn,,0,0,0,,他很快就会回来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.27,1:08:11.29,cn,,0,0,0,,如果我是你就省点力气
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.40,1:08:13.56,cn,,0,0,0,,你离被闷死已经不远了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.61,1:08:19.08,cn,,0,0,0,,还有十分钟杰德就要被淹没了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.14,1:08:21.98,cn,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们的合作很愉快 也许我们的关系能更进一步
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.08,1:08:24.07,cn,,0,0,0,,等等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.15,1:08:25.84,cn,,0,0,0,,怎么了?你不喜欢吻我吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.95,1:08:29.85,cn,,0,0,0,,不 我喜欢 感觉棒极了 被扇耳光有那么点疼 但...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.95,1:08:34.32,cn,,0,0,0,,- 就是说你不喜欢我 - 我当然喜欢你 你非常特别
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.43,1:08:36.76,cn,,0,0,0,,你让人无法抗拒...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.83,1:08:40.76,cn,,0,0,0,,但我们之间存在着一些障碍...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.83,1:08:45.10,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我只是...你不是... - 我不是什么戴利先生?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.94,1:08:50.93,cn,,0,0,0,,好吧 你的身体是...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.28,1:08:53.64,cn,,0,0,0,,身体是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.22,1:09:06.85,cn,,0,0,0,,美好的东西 你的身体非常美好 非常了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.90,1:09:14.06,cn,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.54,1:09:20.87,cn,,0,0,0,,男士们 能帮我们挡一会儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.21,1:09:28.54,cn,,0,0,0,,看来只有这个办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.08,1:09:32.88,cn,,0,0,0,,不要!那是人类发明的第一架飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.98,1:09:35.65,cn,,0,0,0,,它是用木板做的纸糊的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.72,1:09:39.25,cn,,0,0,0,,它是用云杉木和帆布做的 汇聚了老一代美国人的精巧工艺
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.39,1:09:41.86,cn,,0,0,0,,你到底上不上来?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.40,1:09:49.83,cn,,0,0,0,,- 让开! - 没门
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.57,1:09:52.90,cn,,0,0,0,,他们逃了!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.04,1:10:00.20,cn,,0,0,0,,抓稳了戴利先生 这事儿越来越有意思了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.68,1:10:09.95,cn,,0,0,0,,是个女的在开!她是不是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.09,1:10:13.35,cn,,0,0,0,,- 看清楚 小子们 - 哦 她飞得真好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.11,1:10:33.04,cn,,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.11,1:10:35.27,cn,,0,0,0,,一根线卡住了 我去松开它
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.38,1:10:37.57,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你来控制方向杆 - 不 我不要!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:39.21,cn,,0,0,0,,我知道你还有激情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.28,1:10:42.88,cn,,0,0,0,,有激情不代表会开飞机 开飞机要飞行执照的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:44.48,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 交给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:48.89,cn,,0,0,0,,不要吧!我不要这个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.76,1:10:55.43,cn,,0,0,0,,别到处看戴利先生 你在驾驶飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.98,1:11:08.64,cn,,0,0,0,,亚伯!开门!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.00,1:11:27.59,cn,,0,0,0,,- 行了! - 下降!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.83,1:11:32.20,cn,,0,0,0,,拉升!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.31,1:11:39.43,cn,,0,0,0,,好样的!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.51,1:11:41.20,cn,,0,0,0,,一路顺风 阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.31,1:11:42.71,cn,,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.35,1:12:23.65,cn,,0,0,0,,你有点紧张啊 蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.72,1:12:25.92,cn,,0,0,0,,我就当是做热沙按摩
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.32,1:12:30.52,cn,,0,0,0,,沙浴能帮助我恢复活力 去角质的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.26,1:12:32.66,cn,,0,0,0,,你放弃了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.83,1:12:34.66,cn,,0,0,0,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.33,1:12:39.46,cn,,0,0,0,,我可以让时间流逝的更快些
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.44,1:12:47.10,cn,,0,0,0,,什么怪声音?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.87,1:13:10.46,cn,,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.64,1:13:14.04,cn,,0,0,0,,站住别动 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.54,1:13:16.23,cn,,0,0,0,,哇 哇...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.31,1:13:18.80,cn,,0,0,0,,你的出场很漂亮啊 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.91,1:13:20.31,cn,,0,0,0,,该去挖点援军来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.41,1:13:22.88,cn,,0,0,0,,你朋友快淹死了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.95,1:13:25.31,cn,,0,0,0,,但愿你已经想到了密码
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.42,1:13:26.94,cn,,0,0,0,,- 把杰德给我 - 哦 不不不
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.05,1:13:29.78,cn,,0,0,0,,先给我密码 还有金牌
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.89,1:13:31.48,cn,,0,0,0,,我会把金牌和密码给你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.59,1:13:33.25,cn,,0,0,0,,不过你先放了我的朋友们 还有把他给我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.39,1:13:37.22,cn,,0,0,0,,我愿意什么时候放人就什么时候放人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.29,1:13:38.92,cn,,0,0,0,,好极了 那我什么时候愿意给你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.00,1:13:40.72,cn,,0,0,0,,我就什么时候给你 怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.80,1:13:43.49,cn,,0,0,0,,给我密码和金牌 马上
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.60,1:13:45.57,cn,,0,0,0,,否则我就杀光你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.64,1:13:48.43,cn,,0,0,0,,首先拿这个胡子拉楂的小牛仔开刀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.51,1:13:51.91,cn,,0,0,0,,我才不胡子拉楂 铁人 把这个坏蛋交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.98,1:13:54.60,cn,,0,0,0,,别担心 我能处理 你不先放了我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.68,1:13:56.58,cn,,0,0,0,,你就别想拿到密码和金牌
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.65,1:13:58.08,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你给我听好 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.15,1:14:01.02,cn,,0,0,0,,我的外号不是什么值得信赖的卡门拉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.12,1:14:03.78,cn,,0,0,0,,给你 我的外号不叫值得信赖的卡门拉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.85,1:14:05.79,cn,,0,0,0,,他们叫我嗜血卡门拉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.86,1:14:09.49,cn,,0,0,0,,这个卡门拉想要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.59,1:14:11.89,cn,,0,0,0,,就要立刻得到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.96,1:14:15.16,cn,,0,0,0,,这个卡门拉现在要的就是金牌和密码
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.23,1:14:18.76,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你的外号很长啊 - 用埃及语会短一些
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.84,1:14:20.56,cn,,0,0,0,,很好 把他给我 我就给你密码和金牌
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.64,1:14:23.70,cn,,0,0,0,,我看你再敢碰它一下 我就立刻杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.77,1:14:25.40,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 别碰它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.48,1:14:28.34,cn,,0,0,0,,- 这里是禁止触碰区域! - 好 好吧...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.41,1:14:32.44,cn,,0,0,0,,哦上帝 我简直不敢相信你又过界了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.52,1:14:35.95,cn,,0,0,0,,难以置信 上帝 我真想马上杀了你...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.02,1:14:39.75,cn,,0,0,0,,要不是你知道密码 你早就没命了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.82,1:14:42.82,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你会死的很难看 - 可惜我知道密码
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.03,1:14:46.99,cn,,0,0,0,,不许你的手越过这条线
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.10,1:14:53.00,cn,,0,0,0,,胆大包天!如果你再啰嗦一句 我就杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.10,1:14:54.59,cn,,0,0,0,,听明白没有?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.67,1:14:56.54,cn,,0,0,0,,不许说话 上帝 我看到你嘴巴动了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.64,1:14:58.77,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我没想开口说话 - 哦 上帝 不许说话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.84,1:15:00.97,cn,,0,0,0,,你再说一句我就掐死你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.04,1:15:06.18,cn,,0,0,0,,把金牌和密码给我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.45,1:15:09.11,cn,,0,0,0,,可以 你先放了杰德还有我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.99,1:15:11.39,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你又犯规了 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.49,1:15:13.39,cn,,0,0,0,,你不仅说话了而且又把手伸过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.49,1:15:15.36,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 我可以跟你绕一晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.46,1:15:16.82,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不如这样 - 你给我听好...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.89,1:15:19.19,cn,,0,0,0,,我可以先不杀你 虽然我很想很想杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.30,1:15:21.32,cn,,0,0,0,,我给你五秒钟的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.40,1:15:24.13,cn,,0,0,0,,交出金牌和密码
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.20,1:15:27.80,cn,,0,0,0,,我们知道密码了 是圆周率
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.21,1:15:32.90,cn,,0,0,0,,- 3.14159265 - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.01,1:15:34.64,cn,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.38,1:15:41.41,cn,,0,0,0,,这个怪老头 还会唱歌 唱起来像只金丝雀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.15,1:15:43.59,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.69,1:15:46.18,cn,,0,0,0,,你少废话!忘了教训了?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.56,1:15:48.08,cn,,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.19,1:15:53.59,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没事 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.70,1:15:56.17,cn,,0,0,0,,你肯定气坏了吧 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.10,1:16:01.16,cn,,0,0,0,,你失去了所有的筹码
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.54,1:16:06.24,cn,,0,0,0,,你肯定沮丧到不行
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.92,1:16:17.94,cn,,0,0,0,,听到嗡嗡声了没有?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.56,1:16:21.58,cn,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么声音吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.69,1:16:25.13,cn,,0,0,0,,我在用修辞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.80,1:16:29.42,cn,,0,0,0,,那就是末日的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.27,1:16:38.80,cn,,0,0,0,,对不起 杰德
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.91,1:16:41.57,cn,,0,0,0,,你尽力了铁人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.21,1:16:44.48,cn,,0,0,0,,见鬼 我们差点就赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.58,1:16:47.78,cn,,0,0,0,,不 我是说我很抱歉 前几年我一直不在博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.39,1:16:52.32,cn,,0,0,0,,- 否则这一切都不会发生 - 你还不明白吗 铁人?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.42,1:16:54.82,cn,,0,0,0,,我打给你不是我们需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.93,1:16:56.59,cn,,0,0,0,,我们确实有点小麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.66,1:16:58.15,cn,,0,0,0,,但这不是我第一次
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.26,1:17:00.89,cn,,0,0,0,,被沙紧紧地埋在下面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.30,1:17:04.73,cn,,0,0,0,,不是 伙计 我打给你是因为你需要我们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.57,1:17:08.94,cn,,0,0,0,,这几年来你一直把自己隐藏在 那套光鲜的西服里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.01,1:17:11.10,cn,,0,0,0,,但在我看来 那只是一个躯壳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.17,1:17:14.08,cn,,0,0,0,,如同行尸走肉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.68,1:17:16.01,cn,,0,0,0,,那不是你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.91,1:17:19.47,cn,,0,0,0,,- 还有件事 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.58,1:17:21.24,cn,,0,0,0,,今夜还没结束
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.95,1:17:25.12,cn,,0,0,0,,我这个小小的午夜牛仔 还有无穷的战斗力
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.19,1:17:28.35,cn,,0,0,0,,你也有 不要气馁
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.35,1:18:02.12,cn,,0,0,0,,卡门拉的统治时代到来了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.19,1:18:03.99,cn,,0,0,0,,埃及第五代君王
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.06,1:18:06.82,cn,,0,0,0,,现在将统治世界!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.40,1:18:10.80,cn,,0,0,0,,我的军队 前进!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.30,1:18:16.24,cn,,0,0,0,,把拉瑞·戴利和他的朋友送进地狱!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.06,1:18:42.69,cn,,0,0,0,,住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.70,1:18:46.57,cn,,0,0,0,,伟大的奥克塔维厄斯回来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.67,1:18:52.07,cn,,0,0,0,,我骑着全世界最最令人闻风丧胆的动物 我骑着
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.08,1:18:56.38,cn,,0,0,0,,一只松鼠!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.02,1:19:02.04,cn,,0,0,0,,前进 我的战马!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.36,1:19:08.26,cn,,0,0,0,,悠着点 姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:10.52,cn,,0,0,0,,你选择缴械投降
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.59,1:19:13.86,cn,,0,0,0,,还是血溅沙场?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.03,1:19:18.66,cn,,0,0,0,,就这个?这就是你的援军?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.57,1:19:22.54,cn,,0,0,0,,不 这才是!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.95,1:19:36.58,cn,,0,0,0,,这是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.65,1:19:38.78,cn,,0,0,0,,我是亚伯拉罕·林肯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.89,1:19:42.32,cn,,0,0,0,,- 先生 你的麻烦大了 - 杀了他!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.77,1:19:51.53,cn,,0,0,0,,恶心的半鸟人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.18,1:20:04.65,cn,,0,0,0,,不 不 不!等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:07.08,cn,,0,0,0,,滚吧 鸟人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.15,1:20:08.85,cn,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 别!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.95,1:20:10.94,cn,,0,0,0,,再见了 鸟人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.09,1:20:13.02,cn,,0,0,0,,别回地下世界!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.12,1:20:15.11,cn,,0,0,0,,对 对 回你们老家去吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.19,1:20:16.75,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢光临 晚安!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.83,1:20:17.88,cn,,0,0,0,,不 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.50,1:20:29.60,cn,,0,0,0,,真是尴尬
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.94,1:20:32.70,cn,,0,0,0,,这儿好象没我什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.28,1:20:38.77,cn,,0,0,0,,记住我的话孩子 家庭不睦 万事不兴
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.55,1:20:42.58,cn,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.29,1:20:47.31,cn,,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办? - 我也不知道怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.53,1:20:52.12,cn,,0,0,0,,我要看到他死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.33,1:20:56.63,cn,,0,0,0,,士兵 杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.67,1:21:01.47,cn,,0,0,0,,又怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.87,1:21:07.00,cn,,0,0,0,,我们现在不准备
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.08,1:21:10.20,cn,,0,0,0,,攻击!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.02,1:21:20.82,cn,,0,0,0,,给我上!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.54,1:21:43.21,cn,,0,0,0,,别担心 拉瑞 我去救杰迪戴亚!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.28,1:21:44.94,cn,,0,0,0,,你去后面包抄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.35,1:21:49.25,cn,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你在干嘛? - 我在找地方隐蔽
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:51.58,cn,,0,0,0,,隐蔽?你在搞什么! 快 我们这儿需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.09,1:21:55.72,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我是个失败者 - 不 你不是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.83,1:21:58.56,cn,,0,0,0,,小比格霍恩河战役 我领导208个美国人打仗 最后全军覆灭
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.66,1:22:00.36,cn,,0,0,0,,你尝过这种滋味吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.56,1:22:06.00,cn,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有 那感觉不好 真的不好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.07,1:22:08.50,cn,,0,0,0,,- 感觉不好 - 当然 我也就能动动嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.57,1:22:11.34,cn,,0,0,0,,干真的不行 我不配肩膀上的军衔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.84,1:22:16.18,cn,,0,0,0,,人们永远只记得我的失败
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.28,1:22:20.37,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.75,1:22:22.74,cn,,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.45,1:22:26.18,cn,,0,0,0,,现在 当下 就在今夜
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.66,1:22:29.56,cn,,0,0,0,,这场战役将永垂青史
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.29,1:22:32.96,cn,,0,0,0,,这是你的最后一战
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.65,1:22:53.14,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要一位领袖 - 是啊 他们需要领袖
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.08,1:22:57.31,cn,,0,0,0,,是吗?你愿意去领导他们吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:23:00.15,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是 我愿意 - 那就站起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.79,1:23:01.92,cn,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样? - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.99,1:23:03.36,cn,,0,0,0,,我们走!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.66,1:23:07.06,cn,,0,0,0,,太糟了!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.56,1:23:08.55,cn,,0,0,0,,拉瑞!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.30,1:23:10.39,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 亚伯!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.47,1:23:11.46,cn,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.60,1:23:12.69,cn,,0,0,0,,哦 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.77,1:23:14.46,cn,,0,0,0,,你是谁?这是我的博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.84,1:23:16.60,cn,,0,0,0,,他是我的人 你走开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.81,1:23:18.36,cn,,0,0,0,,你尽管拉人 你这个野蛮人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.98,1:23:19.96,cn,,0,0,0,,少废话 你这个太空佬
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.04,1:23:21.07,cn,,0,0,0,,伙计们!嘿 伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.14,1:23:23.01,cn,,0,0,0,,现在不是争这些的时候 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.28,1:23:26.61,cn,,0,0,0,,德克斯特 你知道规矩
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.58,1:23:30.45,cn,,0,0,0,,好吗 再胡闹就请你们吃耳光
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.52,1:23:31.85,cn,,0,0,0,,给你一耳光
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.10,1:23:41.43,cn,,0,0,0,,住手 都给我住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.00,1:23:44.99,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 你们都是高贵的僧帽猴
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.87,1:23:47.67,cn,,0,0,0,,应该一直对外 抗击外敌
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.54,1:23:52.84,cn,,0,0,0,,团结起来 行吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.94,1:23:54.84,cn,,0,0,0,,快 冲上去 给我打
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:59.65,cn,,0,0,0,,- 杰迪戴亚 大家需要我们 - 我恐怕不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.05,1:24:02.52,cn,,0,0,0,,恐怕我的日子到头了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.02,1:24:08.86,cn,,0,0,0,,奥克塔维厄斯 记住我的精神 自由 狂野...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.13,1:24:13.56,cn,,0,0,0,,- 还不是说遗言的时候 - 我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:15.76,cn,,0,0,0,,我还想回忆一下我们的那段事
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.83,1:24:18.13,cn,,0,0,0,,我们是怎么从敌人变成朋友的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.30,1:24:20.63,cn,,0,0,0,,- 不要! - 你想哭就哭吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.70,1:24:23.97,cn,,0,0,0,,不!因为你还死不了!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.95,1:24:37.42,cn,,0,0,0,,- 该我们上场了 - 拿着剑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.55,1:24:39.99,cn,,0,0,0,,拿剑来!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.21,1:24:58.87,cn,,0,0,0,,上面!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.13,1:25:19.36,cn,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.97,1:25:25.70,cn,,0,0,0,,你打 你踢! 你打 你踢!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.77,1:25:29.10,cn,,0,0,0,,你打 你踢! 干得漂亮 伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.04,1:25:34.41,cn,,0,0,0,,你们好啊 伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.58,1:26:07.30,cn,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 再好没有
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.41,1:26:09.57,cn,,0,0,0,,听着 一看到我的信号就立刻打开门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.65,1:26:12.48,cn,,0,0,0,,- 看来你成竹在胸 - 我要去搞点小破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.62,1:26:20.09,cn,,0,0,0,,金牌给我 马上!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.16,1:26:21.59,cn,,0,0,0,,好的 当然 我会给你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.66,1:26:23.65,cn,,0,0,0,,告诉我你们谁是头 我就给他
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.76,1:26:26.25,cn,,0,0,0,,要不我给卡门拉? 他看上去是你们头 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.53,1:26:30.19,cn,,0,0,0,,- 放屁 他才不是什么头 - 是吗? 我看一直是他在说了算
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.30,1:26:32.29,cn,,0,0,0,,算了 你就告诉我你们谁是头 我就给谁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.37,1:26:34.77,cn,,0,0,0,,我是头!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.14,1:26:39.30,cn,,0,0,0,,他是个农民 我才是这里唯一有贵族血统的人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.38,1:26:42.34,cn,,0,0,0,,是吗?可是他看上去有更多勋章 帽子也更大 不过...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.45,1:26:44.47,cn,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你确实有很多勋章
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:47.18,cn,,0,0,0,,但是你要再敢用你的小手碰一下金牌
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.28,1:26:50.12,cn,,0,0,0,,我就要你好看
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.19,1:26:52.05,cn,,0,0,0,,你干嘛要伤害小拿拿?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.12,1:26:55.49,cn,,0,0,0,,我能自己解决 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.56,1:26:58.65,cn,,0,0,0,,你什么也解决不了 你连话都说不清楚 蠢货!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.73,1:27:02.66,cn,,0,0,0,,没问题 你要是吗 我给你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.54,1:27:08.13,cn,,0,0,0,,你这个小杂种
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.34,1:27:17.75,cn,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 戴利先生 让他们自相残杀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.85,1:27:21.65,cn,,0,0,0,,对 我不敢邀功 这主意是亚伯拉罕·林肯想出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.72,1:27:24.08,cn,,0,0,0,,家庭不睦 万事不兴...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.92,1:27:26.91,cn,,0,0,0,,- 还做得不够 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.02,1:27:30.72,cn,,0,0,0,,刚才你就应该自己逃命的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.33,1:27:34.59,cn,,0,0,0,,可惜你又落在了我手里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.00,1:27:36.33,cn,,0,0,0,,我现在最想做的事就是亲手杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.12,1:28:28.48,cn,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.65,1:28:32.09,cn,,0,0,0,,我是个守卫
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.76,1:28:35.55,cn,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.73,1:28:46.67,cn,,0,0,0,,胜利属于我们!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.44,1:28:49.60,cn,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.58,1:28:57.27,cn,,0,0,0,,我说什么来着!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.35,1:28:59.21,cn,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.09,1:29:06.52,cn,,0,0,0,,我看到有个人终于找回他的激情了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.62,1:29:10.46,cn,,0,0,0,,史密森尼战役
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.09,1:29:15.50,cn,,0,0,0,,将是一场永远不为人知的伟大战役
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.87,1:29:19.20,cn,,0,0,0,,我们都见证了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.61,1:29:24.20,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.01,1:29:28.81,cn,,0,0,0,,噢 老天 还有一个小时就天亮了 我得把你们都弄回去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.88,1:29:32.87,cn,,0,0,0,,我不得不提醒你铁人 那儿的人不再需要我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.98,1:29:34.35,cn,,0,0,0,,不 我需要
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.02,1:29:40.72,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 可以载我们一程吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.02,1:29:43.86,cn,,0,0,0,,当然 我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.66,1:29:48.15,cn,,0,0,0,,稍等 我还有件事要办
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.17,1:29:52.07,cn,,0,0,0,,快 孩子!来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:54.00,cn,,0,0,0,,跳进去!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.87,1:29:58.31,cn,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.41,1:30:05.31,cn,,0,0,0,,别客气! 记得天亮前一定要回去!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.06,1:30:21.96,cn,,0,0,0,,这真是一个光明的时代
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.12,1:30:46.78,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 动作快
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.89,1:30:49.95,cn,,0,0,0,,记得和同伴呆在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.06,1:30:51.42,cn,,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.41,1:31:04.13,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 你回到该回的地方了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.28,1:31:08.07,cn,,0,0,0,,我想是的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.88,1:31:16.37,cn,,0,0,0,,我想我该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.79,1:31:20.31,cn,,0,0,0,,阿梅莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.83,1:31:25.56,cn,,0,0,0,,早些时候我想告诉你的那件事...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.40,1:31:30.89,cn,,0,0,0,,我真的很难说出口
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.97,1:31:35.99,cn,,0,0,0,,- 但是 一旦天亮... - 我知道会发生什么 戴利先生
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.11,1:31:37.47,cn,,0,0,0,,我一直知道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.24,1:31:40.94,cn,,0,0,0,,不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.01,1:31:44.97,cn,,0,0,0,,在一夜之间 你给了我一生都未曾体验过的冒险经历
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.12,1:31:50.52,cn,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天的日出一定特别美丽
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.86,1:32:00.35,cn,,0,0,0,,要快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.64,1:32:10.97,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.19,1:33:05.99,cn,,0,0,0,,不知道你怎么想 伙计 可这个老牛仔才攻到二垒
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.90,1:33:11.30,cn,,0,0,0,,- 她飞走了 - 头也不回...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.87,1:33:14.56,cn,,0,0,0,,加拿大
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.57,1:33:17.40,cn,,0,0,0,,她在往加拿大飞
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.74,1:33:21.71,cn,,0,0,0,,航向正确
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.32,1:33:27.65,cn,,0,0,0,,去地下室 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.72,1:33:29.18,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 晚上好 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.25,1:33:30.72,cn,,0,0,0,,孩子 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.32,1:33:35.09,cn,,0,0,0,,劳伦斯!谢谢你把他们都带回来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.19,1:33:37.89,cn,,0,0,0,,你干的真是太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.99,1:33:41.43,cn,,0,0,0,,可是他们不能在地下室躲一辈子
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.50,1:33:43.12,cn,,0,0,0,,不 我已经想到办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.20,1:33:44.32,cn,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.40,1:33:46.20,cn,,0,0,0,,日出 笨瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.20,1:33:49.40,cn,,0,0,0,,我们摩艾朋友说的对 日出即将来临
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.51,1:33:50.94,cn,,0,0,0,,泰德
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.01,1:33:52.50,cn,,0,0,0,,还记得那天晚上你和我说的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.58,1:33:53.87,cn,,0,0,0,,你说幸福的关键是
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.94,1:33:55.67,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我说了吗? - 你说 幸福的关键是...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.74,1:33:58.21,cn,,0,0,0,,然后太阳出来你就冻住了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.28,1:34:00.04,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我想我知道答案了 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.55,1:34:03.85,cn,,0,0,0,,就是做你爱做的事 对不对 和你爱的人在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.12,1:34:07.95,cn,,0,0,0,,其实 我想说的是"锻炼身体"
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.06,1:34:09.46,cn,,0,0,0,,不过你说的也不错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.20,1:34:17.39,cn,,0,0,0,,- 劳伦斯 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.74,1:34:21.40,cn,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.77,1:34:25.21,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.12,1:34:43.75,cn,,0,0,0,,朋友们 漫长的等待终于结束 经过了2个月的整修
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.83,1:34:47.56,cn,,0,0,0,,今夜 自然历史博物馆将重新对公众开放
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.63,1:34:50.00,cn,,0,0,0,,如你所见 纽约市民正迫不及待的涌进博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:52.62,cn,,0,0,0,,想亲身体验博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.74,1:34:54.46,cn,,0,0,0,,新推出的夜游项目
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.57,1:34:57.27,cn,,0,0,0,,据说夜间博物馆的展品 比以往更加栩栩如生
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.28,1:35:10.51,cn,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 好啊 好啊 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.35,1:35:13.98,cn,,0,0,0,,都过了这么久了 这身制服倒还合身
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.09,1:35:16.46,cn,,0,0,0,,是啊 不过也没过多久嘛...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.36,1:35:21.32,cn,,0,0,0,,那么 这场喜庆回归的代价是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.43,1:35:24.87,cn,,0,0,0,,还是适应不了商场 被裁了?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.67,1:35:29.64,cn,,0,0,0,,实际上 我把公司卖了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.71,1:35:32.67,cn,,0,0,0,,这个世界的变化令人难以捉摸
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.78,1:35:35.61,cn,,0,0,0,,前一天我们还在清理所有老展品
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.68,1:35:41.71,cn,,0,0,0,,后一天 一个富有的无名氏 突然捐助了博物馆一大笔资金
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.82,1:35:45.78,cn,,0,0,0,,条件就是 保持所有老展品不变...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.46,1:35:52.83,cn,,0,0,0,,- 很明显 也不是一点没变 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.90,1:35:55.83,cn,,0,0,0,,注意 女士们先生们 我是西奥多·罗斯福
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.90,1:36:00.73,cn,,0,0,0,,一个自然主义者 又名狂野骑士 美国的第26任总统
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.84,1:36:04.33,cn,,0,0,0,,跟上 孩子 冒险开始 劳伦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.88,1:36:12.75,cn,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们这些笨瓜给我带口香糖吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.59,1:36:23.92,cn,,0,0,0,,大约3000年前 我父母给了我这块金牌
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.03,1:36:28.19,cn,,0,0,0,,这是埃及人民最至高无上的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.26,1:36:31.10,cn,,0,0,0,,- 它有什么用? - 什么用?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.20,1:36:33.23,cn,,0,0,0,,对 如果没用的话要它来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.37,1:36:35.46,cn,,0,0,0,,告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.54,1:36:40.07,cn,,0,0,0,,实际上 它是一块复活金牌 可以让这里的展览品都活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.18,1:36:41.61,cn,,0,0,0,,好了 别开玩笑 它到底有什么用?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.28,1:36:45.77,cn,,0,0,0,,没用 只是装饰品
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.88,1:36:47.21,cn,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.38,1:36:52.25,cn,,0,0,0,,这里烂透了 这个恐龙看上去一点都不真实
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.35,1:36:55.45,cn,,0,0,0,,没错 老兄 这里的电动技术太落后了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.93,1:37:06.37,cn,,0,0,0,,- 猛犸象? - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.44,1:37:07.87,cn,,0,0,0,,绝种了!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.24,1:37:10.60,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我已经跟不上科技发展了 - 是啊 做的像真的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.71,1:37:12.64,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 - 问你件事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.04,1:37:14.87,cn,,0,0,0,,这次你打算做久一点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.94,1:37:17.61,cn,,0,0,0,,还是像上次一样干了一半 又去干别的?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.71,1:37:20.15,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我会呆下去 - 一直呆下去?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.25,1:37:21.44,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.08,1:37:27.61,cn,,0,0,0,,很好 作为一个守卫 你...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.46,1:37:30.72,cn,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.96,1:37:33.55,cn,,0,0,0,,我没听清
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.90,1:37:41.13,cn,,0,0,0,,你 小孩!不可以抱展览品
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.84,1:38:18.90,cn,,0,0,0,,打扰了 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.97,1:38:20.97,cn,,0,0,0,,请原谅我的冒昧 我只是...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.31,1:38:24.51,cn,,0,0,0,,你和我认识的一个人长得很像...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.28,1:38:26.68,cn,,0,0,0,,很多人都这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.78,1:38:30.31,cn,,0,0,0,,- 是吗? - 对 可能是我长了一张大众脸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.02,1:38:32.71,cn,,0,0,0,,- 大众脸 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.79,1:38:36.78,cn,,0,0,0,,你不会碰巧和阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特 有什么亲属关系吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.56,1:38:38.96,cn,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.03,1:38:41.02,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我想没有 - 当然没有
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.13,1:38:45.07,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 也许... - 我只是忍不住想问 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.67,1:38:49.16,cn,,0,0,0,,她是那个第一个飞越太平洋的女性吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.24,1:38:51.07,cn,,0,0,0,,- 大西洋 - 对 是大西洋
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.17,1:38:53.66,cn,,0,0,0,,第一个飞越大西洋的女性 她还获得过飞行十字勋章
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.74,1:38:55.33,cn,,0,0,0,,女性当中也是第一个
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.08,1:38:59.24,cn,,0,0,0,,- 真酷啊 - 对 她真的很酷
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.69,1:39:10.25,cn,,0,0,0,,你应该去微缩模型馆看看
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.93,1:39:14.49,cn,,0,0,0,,你能给我带路吗?我总是迷路
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.93,1:39:20.89,cn,,0,0,0,,好的 当然 我来带路 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.54,1:39:23.06,cn,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.57,1:39:25.73,cn,,0,0,0,,- 我叫拉瑞·戴利 - 苔丝
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.70,1:39:52.00,cn,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.81,1:40:03.87,cn,,0,0,0,,- 约瑟夫 吃晚饭了! - 马上来 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.95,1:40:08.14,cn,,0,0,0,,乔伊·摩托罗拉 马上给我下楼吃饭!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.25,1:40:11.74,cn,,0,0,0,,我说了马上来 妈 我正在研究一个很重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.10,1:44:40.00,cn,,0,0,0,,